   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `rep` | `dim, dim^2, distinct total weights, G diagonal` |\n| --- | --- |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{8, 64, 19, {1, 1, 1, 2, 6, 9, 4, 9}}` |\n| `{1, 1, 0}` | `{3, 9, 6, {1, 1, 1}}` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{6, 36, 15, {1, 2, 4, 2, 8, 16}}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{15, 225, 36, {1, 1, 2, 3, 24, 32, 4, 12, 24, 64, 288, 576, 36, 128, 576}}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{15, 225, 36, {1, 2, 4, 1, 4, 12, 8, 24, 64, 8, 48, 24, 128, 144, 256}}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{24, 576, 57, {1, 1, 3, 4, 60, 75, 12, 24, 120, 225, 2880, 4800, 36, 144, 240, 900, 2880, 9600, 51840, 129600, 576, 2700, 19200, 129600}}` |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"gl3 relations\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"G positive invariant unique\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"nilpotency\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"[S_a(u),S_b(v)]=0 (twisted, 3 pairs)\"}` | `{{True, True}, {True}}` |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `58 ms` |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"gl3 relations\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"G positive invariant unique\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"nilpotency\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"[S_a(u),S_b(v)]=0 (twisted, 3 pairs)\"}` | `{{True, True}, {True}}` |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `40 ms` |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"gl3 relations\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"G positive invariant unique\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"nilpotency\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"[S_a(u),S_b(v)]=0 (twisted, 3 pairs)\"}` | `{{True, True}, {True}}` |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"time\"}` | `35 ms` |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"gl3 relations\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"G positive invariant unique\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"nilpotency\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"[S_a(u),S_b(v)]=0 (twisted, 3 pairs)\"}` | `{{True, True}, {True}}` |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `244 ms` |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"gl3 relations\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"G positive invariant unique\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"nilpotency\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"[S_a(u),S_b(v)]=0 (twisted, 3 pairs)\"}` | `{{True, True}, {True}}` |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"time\"}` | `308 ms` |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"gl3 relations\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"G positive invariant unique\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"nilpotency\"}` | `True` |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `19 ms` |",
