  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## E1. Exact HW decomposition of V(x)V and canonical HW kets",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* E1. Exact HW decomposition of V(x)V for every rep: HW vectors = common null space of the total simple raising operators E12, E23 on each total-weight sector (NullSpace over the rationals), put in reduced row echelon form (canonical basis, first nonzero component positive = the sign convention), scaled to primitive integer vectors for the data files. G2 = G(x)G is the invariant inner product (JJ is not Hermitian): gNorm2 is the exact G-norm squared. *)\nck = <||>;\nsecOf[Lam_, mu_] := secOf[Lam, mu] = Flatten[Position[build[Lam][\"wtB\"], mu]];\nraiseM[Lam_] := raiseM[Lam] = With[{R = build[Lam]}, Join[R[\"E1\"][[1, 2]] + R[\"E2\"][[1, 2]], R[\"E1\"][[2, 3]] + R[\"E2\"][[2, 3]]]];\nprim[v_] := With[{w = LCM @@ Denominator[v] v}, w/GCD @@ w];\n(* hwK: list of HW kets of weight mu, coordinates on the weight-mu product states (primitive integer vectors, RowReduce order) *)\nhwK[Lam_, mu_] := hwK[Lam, mu] = With[{sec = secOf[Lam, mu]}, With[{ns = NullSpace[Normal[raiseM[Lam][[All, sec]]]]}, If[ns === {}, {}, prim /@ RowReduce[ns]]]];\nembed[Lam_, mu_, v_] := Normal[SparseArray[Thread[secOf[Lam, mu] -> v], build[Lam][\"d2\"]]];\nhwSecsOf[Lam_] := hwSecsOf[Lam] = Select[Reverse[Sort[Union[build[Lam][\"wtB\"]]]], Length[hwK[Lam, #]] > 0 &];\ngNorm2[Lam_, v_] := Total[build[Lam][\"gd2\"] v^2];\ngGram[Lam_, mu_] := With[{H = embed[Lam, mu, #] & /@ hwK[Lam, mu], g = build[Lam][\"gd2\"]}, Table[Total[g a b], {a, H}, {b, H}]];\nweylDim[mu_] := (mu[[1]] - mu[[2]] + 1) (mu[[2]] - mu[[3]] + 1) (mu[[1]] - mu[[3]] + 2)/2;\n(* CG slice of a two-site vector: component (site-1 GT index nu, site-2 = HW = index 1); the CG coefficient C_nu = slice/Sqrt[G-norm^2] *)\ncgSlice[Lam_, vfull_] := With[{d1 = build[Lam][\"d1\"]}, Table[vfull[[(nu - 1) d1 + 1]], {nu, d1}]];\ntab = {};\nDo[Module[{R = build[Lam], t0 = AbsoluteTime[], secs, mults, sizes},\n  secs = hwSecsOf[Lam]; mults = Length[hwK[Lam, #]] & /@ secs; sizes = Length[secOf[Lam, #]] & /@ secs;\n  ck[{Lam, \"HW kets annihilated by E12tot, E23tot (all sectors)\"}] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Normal[raiseM[Lam] . embed[Lam, mu, v]] === ConstantArray[0, 2 R[\"d2\"]], {mu, secs}, {v, hwK[Lam, mu]}]];\n  ck[{Lam, \"dimension count: Sum mult*dim(mu) = d^2\"}] = {Total[mults weylDim /@ secs], R[\"d2\"]};\n  ck[{Lam, \"all sectors have mult <= 2; sectors\"}] = {Max[mults], Length[secs]};\n  Do[Module[{mu = secs[[i]], hs = hwK[Lam, secs[[i]]], gm},\n    gm = gGram[Lam, mu];\n    AppendTo[tab, {ToString[Lam, InputForm], ToString[mu, InputForm], mults[[i]], sizes[[i]], weylDim[mu], ToString[If[mults[[i]] == 1, gm[[1, 1]], gm], InputForm],\n      ToString[If[mults[[i]] == 1, Flatten[Position[cgSlice[Lam, embed[Lam, mu, hs[[1]]]], _?(# != 0 &)]], \"(copies mix)\"], InputForm]}]], {i, Length[secs]}];\n  ck[{Lam, \"time\"}] = ToString[Round[1000 (AbsoluteTime[] - t0)]] <> \" ms\"], {Lam, repList}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"Lam\", \"mu\", \"mult\", \"weight-space dim\", \"dim V_mu\", \"G-norm^2 of the HW ket (primitive integer vector) / Gram matrix\", \"site-1 GT indices nu with C_nu != 0 (mult 1)\"}}, tab, List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, b_} :> {a, b}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `Lam` | `mu` | `mult` | `weight-space dim` | `dim V_mu` | `G-norm^2 of the HW ket (primitive integer vector) / Gram matrix` | `site-1 GT indices nu with C_nu != 0 (mult 1)` |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{4, 2, 0}` | `1` | `1` | `27` | `1` | `{1}` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{4, 1, 1}` | `1` | `2` | `10` | `2` | `{2}` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 3, 0}` | `1` | `2` | `10` | `2` | `{3}` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 2, 1}` | `2` | `6` | `8` | `{{36, 12}, {12, 84}}` | `\"(copies mix)\"` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{2, 2, 2}` | `1` | `10` | `1` | `288` | `{8}` |\n| `{1, 1, 0}` | `{2, 2, 0}` | `1` | `1` | `6` | `1` | `{1}` |\n| `{1, 1, 0}` | `{2, 1, 1}` | `1` | `2` | `3` | `2` | `{2}` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{4, 4, 0}` | `1` | `1` | `15` | `1` | `{1}` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{4, 3, 1}` | `1` | `2` | `15` | `4` | `{2}` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `3` | `6` | `12` | `{3}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{6, 2, 0}` | `1` | `1` | `60` | `1` | `{1}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{6, 1, 1}` | `1` | `2` | `21` | `2` | `{2}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{5, 3, 0}` | `1` | `2` | `42` | `4` | `{3}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{5, 2, 1}` | `2` | `6` | `24` | `{{6840, 720}, {720, 792}}` | `\"(copies mix)\"` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 4, 0}` | `1` | `3` | `15` | `12` | `{7}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 3, 1}` | `2` | `10` | `15` | `{{864, 432}, {432, 6048}}` | `\"(copies mix)\"` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `14` | `6` | `233280` | `{10, 11}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{3, 3, 2}` | `1` | `18` | `3` | `17280` | `{14}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{6, 4, 0}` | `1` | `1` | `60` | `1` | `{1}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{6, 3, 1}` | `1` | `2` | `42` | `4` | `{2}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{6, 2, 2}` | `1` | `3` | `15` | `12` | `{3}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 5, 0}` | `1` | `2` | `21` | `2` | `{4}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 4, 1}` | `2` | `6` | `24` | `{{312, 24}, {24, 88}}` | `\"(copies mix)\"` |\n| `{3, 