   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `Lam` | `mu` | `mult` | `cas2(mu)` | `cas3(mu)` | `eta_s = theta12 H_s (mult 1: s=1,2; mult 2: eta_1 scalar)` | `A_s = theta12 a_s` | `B_s = theta12^2 b_s` |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{4, 2, 0}` | `1` | `28` | `144` | `{4, -4}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{4, 1, 1}` | `1` | `24` | `132` | `{6, -6}` | `{6, -6}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 3, 0}` | `1` | `24` | `96` | `{6, -6}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 2, 1}` | `2` | `18` | `69` | `9` | `{{{9/2, 3/2}, {3/2, 21/2}}, {{-21/2, 3/2}, {3/2, -9/2}}}` | `{{{6, -3}, {-3, -6}}, {{-6, 3}, {3, 6}}}` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{2, 2, 2}` | `1` | `12` | `24` | `{12, -12}` | `{12, -12}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{1, 1, 0}` | `{2, 2, 0}` | `1` | `12` | `36` | `{2, -2}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{1, 1, 0}` | `{2, 1, 1}` | `1` | `8` | `24` | `{4, -4}` | `{4, -4}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{4, 4, 0}` | `1` | `40` | `200` | `{8, -8}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{4, 3, 1}` | `1` | `32` | `152` | `{12, -12}` | `{12, -12}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `28` | `128` | `{14, -14}` | `{18, -18}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{6, 2, 0}` | `1` | `52` | `380` | `{6, -6}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{6, 1, 1}` | `1` | `48` | `368` | `{8, -8}` | `{8, -8}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{5, 3, 0}` | `1` | `44` | `260` | `{10, -10}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{5, 2, 1}` | `2` | `38` | `233` | `13` | `{{{19/3, 2/3}, {40/3, 44/3}}, {{-44/3, 2/3}, {40/3, -19/3}}}` | `{{{25/3, -4/3}, {-80/3, -25/3}}, {{-25/3, 4/3}, {80/3, 25/3}}}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 4, 0}` | `1` | `40` | `200` | `{12, -12}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 3, 1}` | `2` | `32` | `152` | `16` | `{{{16/3, 8/3}, {4/3, 56/3}}, {{-56/3, 8/3}, {4/3, -16/3}}}` | `{{{40/3, -16/3}, {-8/3, -40/3}}, {{-40/3, 16/3}, {8/3, 40/3}}}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `28` | `128` | `{18, -18}` | `{18, -18}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{3, 3, 2}` | `1` | `24` | `80` | `{20, -20}` | `{20, -20}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{6, 4, 0}` | `1` | `64` | `432` | `{12, -12}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{6, 3, 1}` | `1` | `56` | `384` | `{16, -16}` | `{16, -16}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{6, 2, 2}` | `1` | `52` | `360` | `{18, -18}` | `{24, -24}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 5, 0}` | `1` | `60` | `360` | `{14, -14}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 4, 1}` | `2` | `50` | `285` | `19` | `{{{13, 1}, {6, 22}}, {{-22, 1}, {6, -13}}}` | `{{{9, -2}, {-12, -9}}, {{-9, 2}, {12, 9}}}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 3, 2}` | `2` | `44` | `240` | `22` | `{{{64/3, 8/3}, {4/3, 104/3}}, {{-104/3, 8/3}, {4/3, -64/3}}}` | `{{{40/3, -16/3}, {-8/3, -40/3}}, {{-40/3, 16/3}, {8/3, 40/3}}}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{4, 4, 2}` | `1` | `40` | `180` | `{24, -24}` | `{30, -30}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{4, 3, 3}` | `1` | `36` | `144` | `{26, -26}` | `{36, -36}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{8, 2, 0}` | `1` | `84` | `792` | `{8, -8}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{8, 1, 1}` | `1` | `80` | `780` | `{10, -10}` | `{10, -10}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{7, 3, 0}` | `1` | `72` | `576` | `{14, -14}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{7, 2, 1}` | `2` | `66` | `549` | `17` | `{{{33/4, 3/4}, {105/4, 75/4}}, {{-75/4, 3/4}, {105/4, -33/4}}}` | `{{{21/2, -3/2}, {-105/2, -21/2}}, {{-21/2, 3/2}, {105/2, 21/2}}}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{6, 4, 0}` | `1` | `64` | `432` | `{18, -18}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{6, 3, 1}` | `2` | `56` | `384` | `22` | `{{{7, 3}, {5, 25}}, {{-25, 3}, {5, -7}}}` | `{{{18, -6}, {-10, -18}}, {{-18, 6}, {10, 18}}}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{6, 2, 2}` | `1` | `52` | `360` | `{24, -24}` | `{24, -24}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{5, 5, 0}` | `1` | `60` | `360` | `{20, -20}` | `{0, 0}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{5, 4, 1}` | `2` | `50` | `285` | `25` | `{{{25/4, 15/4}, {5/4, 115/4}}, {{-115/4, 15/4}, {5/4, -25/4}}}` | `{{{45/2, -15/2}, {-5/2, -45/2}}, {{-45/2, 15/2}, {5/2, 45/2}}}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{5, 3, 2}` | `1` | `44` | `240` | `{28, -28}` | `{28, -28}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{4, 4, 2}` | `1` | `40` | `180` | `{30, -30}` | `{30, -30}` | `{0, 0}` |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"one-site Casimirs cas2(Lam), cas3(Lam); c2 = lam2(lam1+1)\"}` | `{{9, 30}, 3}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"(i) fits exact at spare samples (ii) HW space invariant (iii) S2inf = S3inf = 0 at zeta = 0 (iv) no triple pole (v) c2 = lam2(lam1+1) scalar (vi) Casimirs scalar on HW space\"}` | `{True, True, True, True, True, True}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"theta12 scaling: eta, A, B (theta12-scaled) identical at 3 theta points\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"H1 = (\\|Lam\\|^2 - (cas2(mu) - 2 cas2(Lam))/2)/theta12, H2 = -H1\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `1878 ms` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"one-site Casimirs cas2(Lam), cas3(Lam); c2 = lam2(lam1+1)\"}` | `{{4, 8}, 2}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"(i) fits exact at spare samples (ii) HW space invariant (iii) S2inf = S3inf = 0 at zeta = 0 (iv) no triple pole (v) c2 = lam2(lam1+1) scalar (vi) Casimirs scalar on HW space\"}` | `{True, True, True, True, True, True}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"theta12 scaling: eta, A, B (theta12-scaled) identical at 3 theta points\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"H1 = (\\|Lam\\|^2 - (cas2(mu) - 2 cas2(Lam))/2)/theta12, H2 = -H1\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `166 ms` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"one-site Casimirs cas2(Lam), cas3(Lam); c2 = lam2(lam1+1)\"}` | `{{12, 36}, 6}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"(i) fits exact at spare samples (ii) HW space invariant (iii) S2inf = S3inf = 0 at zeta = 0 (iv) no triple pole (v) c2 = lam2(lam1+1) scalar (vi) Casimirs scalar on HW space\"}` | `{True, True, True, True, True, True}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"theta12 scaling: eta, A, B (theta12-scaled) identical at 3 theta points\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"H1 = (\\|Lam\\|^2 - (cas2(mu) - 2 cas2(Lam))/2)/theta12, H2 = -H1\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"time\"}` | `410 ms` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"one-site Casimirs cas2(Lam), cas3(Lam); c2 = lam2(lam1+1)\"}` | `{{16, 72}, 4}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"(i) fits exact at spare samples (ii) HW space invariant (iii) S2inf = S3inf = 0 at zeta = 0 (iv) no triple pole (v) c2 = lam2(lam1+1) scalar (vi) Casimirs scalar on HW space\"}` | `{True, True, True, True, True, True}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"theta12 scaling: eta, A, B (theta12-scaled) identical at 3 theta points\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"H1 = (\\|Lam\\|^2 - (cas2(mu) - 2 cas2(Lam))/2)/theta12, H2 = -H1\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `7782 ms` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"one-site Casimirs cas2(Lam), cas3(Lam); c2 = lam2(lam1+1)\"}` | `{{19, 77}, 8}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"(i) fits exact at spare samples (ii) HW space invariant (iii) S2inf = S3inf = 0 at zeta = 0 (iv) no triple pole (v) c2 = lam2(lam1+1) scalar (vi) Casimirs scalar on HW space\"}` | `{True, True, True, True, True, True}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"theta12 scaling: eta, A, B (theta12-scaled) identical at 3 theta points\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"H1 = (\\|Lam\\|^2 - (cas2(mu) - 2 cas2(Lam))/2)/theta12, H2 = -H1\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"time\"}` | `8923 ms` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"one-site Casimirs cas2(Lam), cas3(Lam); c2 = lam2(lam1+1)\"}` | `{{25, 140}, 5}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"(i) fits exact at spare samples (ii) HW space invariant (iii) S2inf = S3inf = 0 at zeta = 0 (iv) no triple pole (v) c2 = lam2(lam1+1) scalar (vi) Casimirs scalar on HW space\"}` | `{True, True, True, True, True, True}` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"theta12 scaling: eta, A, B (theta12-scaled) identical at 3 theta points\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"H1 = (\\|Lam\\|^2 - (cas2(mu) - 2 cas2(Lam))/2)/theta12, H2 = -H1\"}` | `True` |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `29005 ms` |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
