   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `files written (lines)` | `<\\|{2, 1, 0} -> 46, {1, 1, 0} -> 29, {2, 2, 0} -> 34, {3, 1, 0} -> 63, {3, 2, 0} -> 63, {4, 1, 0} -> 80\\|>` |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `adjoint CG tables: branch` | `D0` | `{nu, cA, cB} (unnormalised slice cA + Sqrt[D0] cB)` | `G-norm^2 pair (n0, n1): n0 + n1 Sqrt[D0]` |  |\n| `CG {4, 2, 0} copy 1` | `0` | `{{1, 1, 0}}` | `{1, 0}` |  |\n| `CG {4, 1, 1} copy 1` | `0` | `{{2, -1, 0}}` | `{2, 0}` |  |\n| `CG {3, 3, 0} copy 1` | `0` | `{{3, -1, 0}}` | `{2, 0}` |  |\n| `CG {3, 2, 1} copy 1` | `5` | `{{4, 21, -9}, {5, -3, 3}}` | `{7560, -3240}` |  |\n| `CG {3, 2, 1} copy 2` | `5` | `{{4, 21, 9}, {5, -3, -3}}` | `{7560, 3240}` |  |\n| `CG {2, 2, 2} copy 1` | `0` | `{{8, 2, 0}}` | `{288, 0}` |  |\n| `Lam` | `mu` | `mult` | `D0` | `{copy, G-norm^2 pair, alpha pairs (s=1,2), beta pairs}` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 2, 1}` | `2` | `5` | `{{1, {7560, -3240}, {{15/2, -3/2}, {-15/2, -3/2}}, {{0, 3}, {0, -3}}}, {2, {7560, 3240}, {{15/2, 3/2}, {-15/2, 3/2}}, {{0, -3}, {0, 3}}}}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{5, 2, 1}` | `2` | `105` | `{{1, {1496880, -136080}, {{21/2, -1/2}, {-21/2, -1/2}}, {{0, 1}, {0, -1}}}, {2, {1496880, 136080}, {{21/2, 1/2}, {-21/2, 1/2}}, {{0, -1}, {0, 1}}}}` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 3, 1}` | `2` | `3` | `{{1, {5225472, -2985984}, {{12, -4}, {-12, -4}}, {{0, 8}, {0, -8}}}, {2, {5225472, 2985984}, {{12, 4}, {-12, 4}}, {{0, -8}, {0, 8}}}}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 4, 1}` | `2` | `105` | `{{1, {18480, -1680}, {{35/2, -1/2}, {-35/2, -1/2}}, {{0, 1}, {0, -1}}}, {2, {18480, 1680}, {{35/2, 1/2}, {-35/2, 1/2}}, {{0, -1}, {0, 1}}}}` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 3, 2}` | `2` | `3` | `{{1, {5225472, -2985984}, {{28, -4}, {-28, -4}}, {{0, 8}, {0, -8}}}, {2, {5225472, 2985984}, {{28, 4}, {-28, 4}}, {{0, -8}, {0, 8}}}}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{7, 2, 1}` | `2` | `21` | `{{1, {5443200, -1088640}, {{27/2, -3/2}, {-27/2, -3/2}}, {{0, 3}, {0, -3}}}, {2, {5443200, 1088640}, {{27/2, 3/2}, {-27/2, 3/2}}, {{0, -3}, {0, 3}}}}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{6, 3, 1}` | `2` | `6` | `{{1, {6912000, -2764800}, {{16, -4}, {-16, -4}}, {{0, 8}, {0, -8}}}, {2, {6912000, 2764800}, {{16, 4}, {-16, 4}}, {{0, -8}, {0, 8}}}}` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{5, 4, 1}` | `2` | `21` | `{{1, {1669248000, -362880000}, {{35/2, -5/2}, {-35/2, -5/2}}, {{0, 5}, {0, -5}}}, {2, {1669248000, 362880000}, {{35/2, 5/2}, {-35/2, 5/2}}, {{0, -5}, {0, 5}}}}` |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"mult-2 copies: {G-orthogonal, all Laurent matrices commute}\"}` | `{True, True, True, {True, True}, True}` |  |  |  |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"mult-2 copies: {G-orthogonal, all Laurent matrices commute}\"}` | `{True, True}` |  |  |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"mult-2 copies: {G-orthogonal, all Laurent matrices commute}\"}` | `{True, True, True}` |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"mult-2 copies: {G-orthogonal, all Laurent matrices commute}\"}` | `{True, True, True, {True, True}, True, {True, True}, True, True}` |  |  |  |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"mult-2 copies: {G-orthogonal, all Laurent matrices commute}\"}` | `{True, True, True, True, {True, True}, {True, True}, True, True}` |  |  |  |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"mult-2 copies: {G-orthogonal, all Laurent matrices commute}\"}` | `{True, True, True, {True, True}, True, {True, True}, True, True, {True, True}, True, True}` |  |  |  |",
