  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* E2 (cont.). Sum rules and closed forms of the untwisted Laurent data. Exact facts used from the table above: eta_2 = -eta_1 and eta_1 = |Lam|^2 - (cas2(mu) - 2 cas2(Lam))/2 (checked for every sector of every rep). (i) Sum rules at u = infinity, as exact matrix identities on every HW space (theta = (1,0)): B1 + B2 = 0 and A1 + A2 + B1 = 0 (i.e. b_1 + b_2 = 0 and a_1 + a_2 + theta_1 b_1 + theta_2 b_2 = 0), plus A2 = -A1 on multiplicity 1. (ii) The no-log relation beta = alpha (eta - alpha)/c2 on every sector: it holds on all multiplicity-2 sectors and on the multiplicity-1 sectors with alpha in {0, eta}; list the exceptions. (iii) alpha_1 = theta12 a_1: exact linear fit over ALL multiplicity-1 sectors of all six reps (and tr A1/2 on multiplicity-2 sectors) with an ansatz linear in {1, T, T^2, T^3, cas2(mu), cas3(mu), cas2(L), cas3(L), T cas2(mu), T cas2(L)}, T = |Lam|, and the discriminating features mu_3 and lam_2; subsets of the ansatz are searched for the smallest exact fit. *)\nck = <||>;\npairVal[pr_, D0_] := pr[[1]] + pr[[2]] Sqrt[D0];\nallKeys = Flatten[Table[{Lam, mu}, {Lam, repList}, {mu, hwSecsOf[Lam]}], 1];\nck[\"(i) B1 + B2 = 0 and A1 + A2 + B1 = 0 as m x m matrices, all sectors of all reps\"] = And @@ Table[With[{ld = lauData[k]}, ld[\"B\"][[1]] + ld[\"B\"][[2]] === 0 ld[\"B\"][[1]] && ld[\"A\"][[1]] + ld[\"A\"][[2]] + ld[\"B\"][[1]] === 0 ld[\"B\"][[1]]], {k, allKeys}];\nck[\"(i') A2 = -A1 on multiplicity 1; on multiplicity 2: A1 + A2 = -B1 and B2 = -B1\"] = And @@ Table[With[{ld = lauData[k]}, If[ld[\"mult\"] == 1, ld[\"A\"][[2]] === -ld[\"A\"][[1]], ld[\"B\"][[2]] === -ld[\"B\"][[1]]]], {k, allKeys}];\nc2Of[Lam_] := Lam[[2]] (Lam[[1]] + 1);\nexc = Select[allKeys, Module[{ld = lauData[#], c2 = c2Of[#[[1]]], eta = lauData[#][\"eta\"][[1, 1, 1]]}, ld[\"mult\"] == 1 && ld[\"A\"][[1, 1, 1]] (eta - ld[\"A\"][[1, 1, 1]])/c2 =!= ld[\"B\"][[1, 1, 1]]] &];\nck[\"(ii) multiplicity-2 sectors: {Lam, mu, beta_1 = alpha_1 (eta - alpha_1)/c2 holds on both copies?}\"] = Table[With[{ld = lauData[k], bd = branchData[k[[1]], k[[2]]], c2 = c2Of[k[[1]]]}, {k[[1]], k[[2]], And @@ Table[Module[{al = pairVal[b[\"alpha\"][[1]], b[\"D0\"]], be = pairVal[b[\"beta\"][[1]], b[\"D0\"]], et = b[\"eta\"][[1, 1]]}, Simplify[be - al (et - al)/c2] === 0], {b, bd}]}], {k, Select[allKeys, lauData[#][\"mult\"] == 2 &]}];\nck[\"(ii') multiplicity-1 sectors violating beta = alpha(eta-alpha)/c2 (they have beta = 0 but alpha not in {0, eta}): {Lam, mu, alpha, eta, c2}\"] = Table[{k[[1]], k[[2]], lauData[k][\"A\"][[1, 1, 1]], lauData[k][\"eta\"][[1, 1, 1]], c2Of[k[[1]]]}, {k, exc}];\nfeat[k_] := Module[{Lam = k[[1]], mu = k[[2]], ld = lauData[k], R = build[k[[1]]], T = Total[k[[1]]], c2L, c3L, c2m, c3m},\n  c2L = cas1[R, 2]; c3L = cas1[R, 3]; c2m = ld[\"cas2\"]; c3m = ld[\"cas3\"];\n  <|\"1\" -> 1, \"T\" -> T, \"T2\" -> T^2, \"T3\" -> T^3, \"c2m\" -> c2m, \"c3m\" -> c3m, \"c2L\" -> c2L, \"c3L\" -> c3L, \"Tc2m\" -> T c2m, \"Tc2L\" -> T c2L, \"mu3\" -> mu[[3]], \"mu2\" -> mu[[2]], \"mu1\" -> mu[[1]], \"l2\" -> Lam[[2]], \"l1\" -> Lam[[1]]|>];\ntarget[k_] := With[{ld = lauData[k]}, If[ld[\"mult\"] == 1, ld[\"A\"][[1, 1, 1]], Tr[ld[\"A\"][[1]]]/2]];\nkeys1 = Select[allKeys, lauData[#][\"mult\"] == 1 &];\nfitTry[names_, keys_] := Module[{M = Table[feat[k][#] & /@ names, {k, keys}], y = target /@ keys, sol},\n  sol = Quiet[LinearSolve[M, y]];\n  If[Head[sol] === LinearSolve, {names, False, None}, {names, True, AssociationThread[names -> sol]}]];\nbase = {\"1\", \"T\", \"T2\", \"T3\", \"c2m\", \"c3m\", \"c2L\", \"c3L\", \"Tc2m\", \"Tc2L\"};\nr0 = fitTry[base, keys1];\n(* searches: all subsets of the ansatz of increasing size that fit exactly *)\nfound = {};\nDo[If[found === {}, found = Select[Table[fitTry[s, keys1], {s, Subsets[base, {n}]}], #[[2]] &]], {n, 1, 8}];\nck[\"(iii) exact fit of alpha_1 over all multiplicity-1 sectors (30 data points): full ansatz solvable?\"] = r0[[2]];\nck[\"(iii) smallest exact subset fits (names -> coefficients)\"] = found;\n(* with the mu3 > 0 structure: alpha/eta on multiplicity-1 sectors *)\nck[\"alpha_1 = 0 exactly when mu3 = 0 (multiplicity-1 sectors)?\"] = And @@ Table[(lauData[k][\"A\"][[1, 1, 1]] === 0) == (k[[2, 3]] == 0), {k, keys1}];\nck[\"alpha_1 - eta_1 on multiplicity-1 sectors with mu3 > 0: {Lam, mu, alpha - eta}\"] = Table[{k[[1]], k[[2]], lauData[k][\"A\"][[1, 1, 1]] - lauData[k][\"eta\"][[1, 1, 1]]}, {k, Select[keys1, #[[2, 3]] > 0 &]}];\n(* the closed form found above, tested on EVERY sector (multiplicity 1: alpha_1 itself; multiplicity 2: the mean of the two copies = tr A1/2) *)\nformA[k_] := With[{T = Total[k[[1]]], c2m = lauData[k][\"cas2\"], c3m = lauData[k][\"cas3\"]}, (4 T (1 + T)^2 - 3 (1 + T) c2m + c3m)/6];\nck[\"closed form alpha = [4T(1+T)^2 - 3(1+T) C2(mu) + C3(mu)]/6 on all 37 sectors (mult 1: alpha_1; mult 2: tr(A1)/2)\"] = And @@ Table[formA[k] === target[k], {k, allKeys}];\nck[\"mult-2 sectors: {Lam, mu, eta, c2, tr A1, tr A1 - (eta + 2 c2), disc = tr^2 - 4 det A1, eta^2 - 4 c2^2}  (disc = (alpha_+ - alpha_-)^2 = beta^2)\"] = Table[With[{ld = lauData[k], c2 = c2Of[k[[1]]]}, {k[[1]], k[[2]], ld[\"eta\"][[1, 1, 1]], c2, Tr[ld[\"A\"][[1]]], Tr[ld[\"A\"][[1]]] - (ld[\"eta\"][[1, 1, 1]] + 2 c2), Tr[ld[\"A\"][[1]]]^2 - 4 Det[ld[\"A\"][[1]]], ld[\"eta\"][[1, 1, 1]]^2 - 4 c2^2}], {k, Select[allKeys, lauData[#][\"mult\"] == 2 &]}];\n(* closed forms of the Casimirs on a HW weight l = (l1,l2,l3): C2 = Sum_i l_i (l_i + 4 - 2i), and C3 = Sum_ijk E_ij E_jk E_ki found by an exact fit on the 32 distinct weights (20-parameter cubic ansatz, overdetermined) *)\nc2Form[l_] := l[[1]]^2 + l[[2]]^2 + l[[3]]^2 + 2 l[[1]] - 2 l[[3]];\nc3Form[l_] := l[[1]]^3 + l[[2]]^3 + l[[3]]^3 + 4 l[[1]]^2 + l[[2]]^2 - 2 l[[3]]^2 - l[[1]] l[[2]] - l[[1]] l[[3]] - l[[2]] l[[3]] + 4 l[[1]] - 2 l[[2]] - 2 l[[3]];\nck[\"C2(l) = l1^2 + l2^2 + l3^2 + 2 l1 - 2 l3 and C3(l) = l1^3 + l2^3 + l3^3 + 4 l1^2 + l2^2 - 2 l3^2 - l1 l2 - l1 l3 - l2 l3 + 4 l1 - 2 l2 - 2 l3: exact on all 37 total-weight sectors and the 6 one-site reps\"] = And @@ Table[c2Form[k[[2]]] === lauData[k][\"cas2\"] && c3Form[k[[2]]] === lauData[k][\"cas3\"], {k, allKeys}] && And @@ Table[c2Form[Lam] === cas1[build[Lam], 2] && c3Form[Lam] === cas1[build[Lam], 3], {Lam, repList}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"item\", \"result\"}}, List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, c_} :> {a, ToString[c, InputForm]}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
