   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `item` | `result` |\n| --- | --- |\n| `(i) B1 + B2 = 0 and A1 + A2 + B1 = 0 as m x m matrices, all sectors of all reps` | `True` |\n| `(i') A2 = -A1 on multiplicity 1; on multiplicity 2: A1 + A2 = -B1 and B2 = -B1` | `True` |\n| `(ii) multiplicity-2 sectors: {Lam, mu, beta_1 = alpha_1 (eta - alpha_1)/c2 holds on both copies?}` | `{{{2, 1, 0}, {3, 2, 1}, True}, {{3, 1, 0}, {5, 2, 1}, True}, {{3, 1, 0}, {4, 3, 1}, True}, {{3, 2, 0}, {5, 4, 1}, True}, {{3, 2, 0}, {5, 3, 2}, False}, {{4, 1, 0}, {7, 2, 1}, True}, {{4, 1, 0}, {6, 3, 1}, True}, {{4, 1, 0}, {5, 4, 1}, True}}` |\n| `(ii') multiplicity-1 sectors violating beta = alpha(eta-alpha)/c2 (they have beta = 0 but alpha not in {0, eta}): {Lam, mu, alpha, eta, c2}` | `{{{2, 2, 0}, {4, 2, 2}, 18, 14, 6}, {{3, 2, 0}, {6, 2, 2}, 24, 18, 8}, {{3, 2, 0}, {4, 4, 2}, 30, 24, 8}, {{3, 2, 0}, {4, 3, 3}, 36, 26, 8}}` |\n| `(iii) exact fit of alpha_1 over all multiplicity-1 sectors (30 data points): full ansatz solvable?` | `True` |\n| `(iii) smallest exact subset fits (names -> coefficients)` | `{{{\"T\", \"T2\", \"T3\", \"c2m\", \"c3m\", \"Tc2m\"}, True, <\\|\"T\" -> 2/3, \"T2\" -> 4/3, \"T3\" -> 2/3, \"c2m\" -> -1/2, \"c3m\" -> 1/6, \"Tc2m\" -> -1/2\\|>}}` |\n| `alpha_1 = 0 exactly when mu3 = 0 (multiplicity-1 sectors)?` | `True` |\n| `alpha_1 - eta_1 on multiplicity-1 sectors with mu3 > 0: {Lam, mu, alpha - eta}` | `{{{2, 1, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, 0}, {{2, 1, 0}, {2, 2, 2}, 0}, {{1, 1, 0}, {2, 1, 1}, 0}, {{2, 2, 0}, {4, 3, 1}, 0}, {{2, 2, 0}, {4, 2, 2}, 4}, {{3, 1, 0}, {6, 1, 1}, 0}, {{3, 1, 0}, {4, 2, 2}, 0}, {{3, 1, 0}, {3, 3, 2}, 0}, {{3, 2, 0}, {6, 3, 1}, 0}, {{3, 2, 0}, {6, 2, 2}, 6}, {{3, 2, 0}, {4, 4, 2}, 6}, {{3, 2, 0}, {4, 3, 3}, 10}, {{4, 1, 0}, {8, 1, 1}, 0}, {{4, 1, 0}, {6, 2, 2}, 0}, {{4, 1, 0}, {5, 3, 2}, 0}, {{4, 1, 0}, {4, 4, 2}, 0}}` |\n| `closed form alpha = [4T(1+T)^2 - 3(1+T) C2(mu) + C3(mu)]/6 on all 37 sectors (mult 1: alpha_1; mult 2: tr(A1)/2)` | `True` |\n| `mult-2 sectors: {Lam, mu, eta, c2, tr A1, tr A1 - (eta + 2 c2), disc = tr^2 - 4 det A1, eta^2 - 4 c2^2}  (disc = (alpha_+ - alpha_-)^2 = beta^2)` | `{{{2, 1, 0}, {3, 2, 1}, 9, 3, 15, 0, 45, 45}, {{3, 1, 0}, {5, 2, 1}, 13, 4, 21, 0, 105, 105}, {{3, 1, 0}, {4, 3, 1}, 16, 4, 24, 0, 192, 192}, {{3, 2, 0}, {5, 4, 1}, 19, 8, 35, 0, 105, 105}, {{3, 2, 0}, {5, 3, 2}, 22, 8, 56, 18, 192, 228}, {{4, 1, 0}, {7, 2, 1}, 17, 5, 27, 0, 189, 189}, {{4, 1, 0}, {6, 3, 1}, 22, 5, 32, 0, 384, 384}, {{4, 1, 0}, {5, 4, 1}, 25, 5, 35, 0, 525, 525}}` |\n| `C2(l) = l1^2 + l2^2 + l3^2 + 2 l1 - 2 l3 and C3(l) = l1^3 + l2^3 + l3^3 + 4 l1^2 + l2^2 - 2 l3^2 - l1 l2 - l1 l3 - l2 l3 + 4 l1 - 2 l2 - 2 l3: exact on all 37 total-weight sectors and the 6 one-site reps` | `True` |",
