  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## E3. The untwisted oper per branch: exponents, polynomial solutions, hypergeometric structure",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* E3. The untwisted oper per HW branch: D0 = dd^3 - S1 dd^2 + S2 dd - S3 with the E2 Laurent data. By the exact scaling of section E2 (H = eta/theta12, a = alpha/theta12, b = beta/theta12^2) the oper at theta = (1,0) (theta12 = 1, u = theta12 x + theta2) carries all the information: its singular points are 0, 1, infinity. Octet copies: exact numbers p + q Sqrt[D0]. (a) indicial exponents at 0, 1 and infinity (y ~ u^d), sum rules at infinity, Fuchs relation; (b) polynomial solutions of D0 and of the direct oper (Pi^p o adjoint o Pi^-p, p = lam1 - lam3), cumulative dimension per degree 0..2 lam1+4; (c) hypergeometric identification: for lam1 = lam2 the exponents at x = 1 contain a consecutive pair and the oper is compared, as an operator, with the 3F2 operator after the gauge y = (1-x)^(lam+1) w; for lam1 != lam2 no consecutive pair exists at either point. *)\nck = <||>;\npairVal[pr_, D0_] := pr[[1]] + pr[[2]] Sqrt[D0];\nodeData[Lam_, mu_, ic_] := Module[{bd = branchData[Lam, mu][[ic]], D0},\n  D0 = bd[\"D0\"];\n  <|\"eta\" -> (pairVal[#, D0] & /@ bd[\"eta\"]), \"alpha\" -> (pairVal[#, D0] & /@ bd[\"alpha\"]), \"beta\" -> (pairVal[#, D0] & /@ bd[\"beta\"]), \"T\" -> Total[Lam], \"c2\" -> Lam[[2]] (Lam[[1]] + 1), \"lam\" -> Lam, \"mu\" -> mu, \"D0\" -> D0|>];\nsfun[dat_] := Module[{T = dat[\"T\"], c2 = dat[\"c2\"], th = {1, 0}, H = dat[\"eta\"], a = dat[\"alpha\"], b = dat[\"beta\"]},\n  {Function[u, T (1/(u - 1) + 1/u)], Function[u, Sum[H[[s]]/(u - th[[s]]) + c2/(u - th[[s]])^2, {s, 2}]], Function[u, Sum[b[[s]]/(u - th[[s]]) + a[[s]]/(u - th[[s]])^2, {s, 2}]]}];\nindData[dat_] := Module[{T = dat[\"T\"], c2 = dat[\"c2\"], H = dat[\"eta\"], a = dat[\"alpha\"], b = dat[\"beta\"], rho, dd, s1, s2, s3, pI, rootsFin, rootsInf, sumRules},\n  pI = rho (rho - 1) (rho - 2) - T rho (rho - 1) + c2 rho;\n  rootsFin = Sort[rho /. Solve[pI == 0, rho]];\n  s1 = 2 T; s2 = H[[1]] + 2 c2; s3 = b[[1]] + 2 a[[1]];\n  rootsInf = Sort[dd /. Solve[dd (dd - 1) (dd - 2) - s1 dd (dd - 1) + s2 dd - s3 == 0, dd]];\n  sumRules = {Simplify[b[[1]] + b[[2]]], Simplify[a[[1]] + a[[2]] + b[[1]]], Simplify[H[[1]] + H[[2]]]};\n  <|\"fin\" -> rootsFin, \"inf\" -> Simplify[rootsInf], \"sumRules\" -> sumRules, \"fuchs\" -> Simplify[2 Total[rootsFin] - Total[rootsInf]]|>];\nuu = Symbol[\"uu\"];\npolyDims[dat_, dmax_] := Module[{S = sfun[dat], P1, P2, P3, Pi2 = (uu (uu - 1))^2, c},\n  P1 = Cancel[Together[Pi2 S[[1]][uu]]]; P2 = Cancel[Together[Pi2 S[[2]][uu]]]; P3 = Cancel[Together[Pi2 S[[3]][uu]]];\n  Table[Module[{p = Sum[c[k] uu^k, {k, 0, D1}], expr, eqs, M, ns},\n    expr = Expand[Pi2 D[p, {uu, 3}] - P1 D[p, {uu, 2}] + P2 D[p, uu] - P3 p];\n    eqs = CoefficientList[expr, uu];\n    M = Simplify[Table[Coefficient[e, c[k]], {e, eqs}, {k, 0, D1}]];\n    ns = If[M === {}, IdentityMatrix[D1 + 1], Simplify /@ NullSpace[M]];\n    {D1, Length[ns], ns}], {D1, 0, dmax}]];\ndirDims[dat_, dmax_] := Module[{p = dat[\"lam\"][[1]] - dat[\"lam\"][[3]], S, Pi1 = uu (uu - 1), imgs, q},\n  S = sfun[dat];\n  imgs = Table[Module[{y = uu^k/Pi1^p, ex},\n     ex = -D[y, {uu, 3}] - D[S[[1]][uu] y, {uu, 2}] - D[S[[2]][uu] y, uu] - S[[3]][uu] y;\n     Expand[Cancel[Together[Pi1^(p + 3) ex]]]], {k, 0, dmax}];\n  Table[Module[{eqs, M, ns},\n    eqs = CoefficientList[Total[Table[q[k] imgs[[k + 1]], {k, 0, D1}]], uu];\n    M = Simplify[Table[Coefficient[e, q[k]], {e, eqs}, {k, 0, D1}]]; ns = If[M === {}, IdentityMatrix[D1 + 1], Simplify /@ NullSpace[M]];\n    {D1, Length[ns], ns}], {D1, 0, dmax}]];\njumpDegrees[res_] := Select[Range[Length[res]], res[[#, 2]] > If[# == 1, 0, res[[# - 1, 2]]] &] - 1;\n(* (c) hypergeometric operator comparison for lam1 = lam2 = lam *)\n(* the 3F2 operator (th + b1 - 1)(th + b2 - 1) th - x (th + a1)(th + a2)(th + a3) applied to a generic f, as the coefficient list of f''', f'', f', f *)\nhypCoeffs[aa_, bb_] := Module[{f, x = Symbol[\"xE3\"], th, p1, p2, p3, q1, q2, q3, hop},\n  th[g_, c_] := x D[g, x] + c g;\n  p1 = th[f[x], 0]; p2 = th[p1, bb[[2]] - 1]; p3 = th[p2, bb[[1]] - 1];\n  q1 = th[f[x], aa[[3]]]; q2 = th[q1, aa[[2]]]; q3 = th[q2, aa[[1]]];\n  hop = Expand[p3 - x q3];\n  Table[Simplify[Coefficient[hop, D[f[x], {x, k}]]], {k, 3, 0, -1}]];\nhypCompare[dat_, dInf_] := Module[{lam = dat[\"lam\"][[1]], S = sfun[dat], be, aa, bb, f, x = Symbol[\"xE3\"], ex, cD, cH, ratio},\n  be = lam + 1; aa = be - dInf; bb = {-lam, -lam - 1};\n  ex = Expand[Simplify[(D[(1 - x)^be f[x], {x, 3}] - S[[1]][x] D[(1 - x)^be f[x], {x, 2}] + S[[2]][x] D[(1 - x)^be f[x], x] - S[[3]][x] (1 - x)^be f[x])/(1 - x)^be]];\n  cD = Table[Simplify[Coefficient[ex, D[f[x], {x, k}]]], {k, 3, 0, -1}];\n  cH = hypCoeffs[aa, bb]; ratio = Simplify[cH[[1]]];\n  {aa, bb, Simplify[cD - cH/ratio] === {0, 0, 0, 0}}];\nbranchesAll = Flatten[Table[Table[{Lam, mu, ic}, {ic, lauData[{Lam, mu}][\"mult\"]}], {Lam, repList}, {mu, hwSecsOf[Lam]}], 2];\ntab = {};\nDo[Module[{Lam = b[[1]], mu = b[[2]], ic = b[[3]], dat, ind, pd, jd, dirD, jdd, expectD, expectDir, t0 = AbsoluteTime[], l1, hyp},\n  dat = odeData[Lam, mu, ic]; l1 = Lam[[1]];\n  ind = indData[dat];\n  pd = polyDims[dat, 2 l1 + 4]; jd = jumpDegrees[pd];\n  dirD = dirDims[dat, 2 l1 + 4]; jdd = jumpDegrees[dirD];\n  expectD = {mu[[1]] + 2, mu[[2]] + 1, mu[[3]]};\n  expectDir = Sort[{2 l1 + 2 - mu[[3]], 2 l1 + 1 - mu[[2]], 2 l1 - mu[[1]]}];\n  hyp = If[Lam[[1]] == Lam[[2]], With[{r = hypCompare[dat, Sort[ind[\"inf\"], Greater]]}, ToString[r[[1 ;; 3]], InputForm]], \"no consecutive pair of exponents at theta_s: not a 3F2 equation\"];\n  AppendTo[tab, {ToString[Lam, InputForm], ToString[mu, InputForm], ic, ToString[ind[\"fin\"], InputForm], ToString[Sort[ind[\"inf\"]], InputForm], ToString[ind[\"sumRules\"], InputForm], ToString[ind[\"fuchs\"], InputForm],\n    ToString[jd, InputForm], ToString[Sort[ind[\"inf\"]] === Sort[expectD], InputForm], ToString[pd[[All, 2]], InputForm], ToString[jdd, InputForm], ToString[Sort[jdd] === expectDir, InputForm], hyp, ToString[Round[1000 (AbsoluteTime[] - t0)]] <> \" ms\"}]], {b, branchesAll}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"Lam\", \"mu\", \"copy\", \"exponents at theta_s (both)\", \"exponents d at infinity (u^d)\", \"sum rules {b1+b2, a1+a2+theta1 b1+theta2 b2, H1+H2}\", \"Fuchs: 2 sum(finite exponents) - sum(d) (expect 3)\", \"degrees of polynomial solutions of D0\", \"d = {mu1+2, mu2+1, mu3} ?\", \"cumulative dim of polynomial solutions of degree <= 0..2 lam1+4\", \"degrees of polynomial solutions of the direct oper\", \"direct degrees = {2 lam1+2-mu3, 2 lam1+1-mu2, 2 lam1-mu1} ?\", \"3F2 test (lam1 = lam2): {a_j, b_j, operator identity after gauge (1-x)^(lam+1)}\", \"time\"}}, tab], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `Lam` | `mu` | `copy` | `exponents at theta_s (both)` | `exponents d at infinity (u^d)` | `sum rules {b1+b2, a1+a2+theta1 b1+theta2 b2, H1+H2}` | `Fuchs: 2 sum(finite exponents) - sum(d) (expect 3)` | `degrees of polynomial solutions of D0` | `d = {mu1+2, mu2+1, mu3} ?` | `cumulative dim of polynomial solutions of degree <= 0..2 lam1+4` | `degrees of polynomial solutions of the direct oper` | `direct degrees = {2 lam1+2-mu3, 2 lam1+1-mu2, 2 lam1-mu1} ?` | `3F2 test (lam1 = lam2): {a_j, b_j, operator identity after gauge (1-x)^(lam+1)}` | `time` |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{4, 2, 0}` | `1` | `{0, 2, 4}` | `{0, 3, 6}` | `{0, 0, 0}` | `3` | `{0, 3, 6}` | `True` | `{1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3}` | `{0, 3, 6}` | `True` | `no consecutive pair of exponents at theta_s: not a 3F2 equation` | `41 ms` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{4, 1, 1}` | `1` | `{0, 2, 4}` | `{1, 2, 6}` | `{0, 0, 0}` | `3` | `{1, 2, 6}` | `True` | `{0, 1, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3}` | `{0, 4, 5}` | `True` | `no consecutive pair of exponents at theta_s: not a 3F2 equation` | `28 ms` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 3, 0}` | `1` | `{0, 2, 4}` | `{0, 4, 5}` | `{0, 0, 0}` | `3` | `{0, 4, 5}` | `True` | `{1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 3, 3, 3, 3}` | `{1, 2, 6}` | `True` | `no consecutive pair of exponents at theta_s: not a 3F2 equation` | `30 ms` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 2, 1}` | `1` | `{0, 2, 4}` | `{1, 3, 5}` | `{0, 0, 0}` | `3` | `{1, 3, 5}` | `True` | `{0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3, 3}` | `{1, 3, 5}` | `True` | `no consecutive pair of exponents at theta_s: not a 3F2 equation` | `218 ms` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 2, 1}` | `2` | `{0, 2, 4}` | `{1, 3, 5}` | `{0, 0, 0}` | `3` | `{1, 3, 5}` | `True` | `{0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3, 3}` | `{1, 3, 5}` | `True` | `no consecutive pair of exponents at theta_s: not a 3F2 equation` | `136 ms` |\n| `{2, 1