   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `Lam` | `mu` | `copy` | `consecutive pair of exponents at some singular point (0, 1: {0,l2+1,l1+2}; inf: {-d})` | `oper is a 3F2 equation (exact operator identity after Moebius map + gauge)` | `first witness: roles {s=0,s=1,s=inf} <- points, a_j, b_j, gauge (e0,e1)` | `time` |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{4, 2, 0}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `3 ms` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{4, 1, 1}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-2, 0, 2}, \"b\" -> {-1, -3}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 2}\\|>` | `99 ms` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 3, 0}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-5, -3, -1}, \"b\" -> {-1, -3}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 5}\\|>` | `79 ms` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 2, 1}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `5 ms` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{3, 2, 1}` | `2` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `7 ms` |\n| `{2, 1, 0}` | `{2, 2, 2}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-3, -1, 1}, \"b\" -> {-1, -3}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 3}\\|>` | `134 ms` |\n| `{1, 1, 0}` | `{2, 2, 0}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, 1, Infinity}, \"a\" -> {-2, -1, 2}, \"b\" -> {-1, -2}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 2}\\|>` | `179 ms` |\n| `{1, 1, 0}` | `{2, 1, 1}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, 1, Infinity}, \"a\" -> {-2, 0, 1}, \"b\" -> {-1, -2}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 2}\\|>` | `106 ms` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{4, 4, 0}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, 1, Infinity}, \"a\" -> {-3, -2, 3}, \"b\" -> {-2, -3}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 3}\\|>` | `143 ms` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{4, 3, 1}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, 1, Infinity}, \"a\" -> {-3, -1, 2}, \"b\" -> {-2, -3}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 3}\\|>` | `69 ms` |\n| `{2, 2, 0}` | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, 1, Infinity}, \"a\" -> {-3, 0, 1}, \"b\" -> {-2, -3}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 3}\\|>` | `131 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{6, 2, 0}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `5 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{6, 1, 1}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-2, 0, 3}, \"b\" -> {-1, -4}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 2}\\|>` | `64 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{5, 3, 0}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `4 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{5, 2, 1}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `10 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{5, 2, 1}` | `2` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `9 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 4, 0}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-6, -4, -1}, \"b\" -> {-1, -4}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 6}\\|>` | `82 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 3, 1}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `8 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 3, 1}` | `2` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `9 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{4, 2, 2}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-3, -1, 2}, \"b\" -> {-1, -4}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 3}\\|>` | `67 ms` |\n| `{3, 1, 0}` | `{3, 3, 2}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-5, -3, 0}, \"b\" -> {-1, -4}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 5}\\|>` | `63 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{6, 4, 0}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `3 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{6, 3, 1}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `2 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{6, 2, 2}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-3, 0, 2}, \"b\" -> {-2, -4}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 3}\\|>` | `68 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 5, 0}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-7, -4, -2}, \"b\" -> {-2, -4}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 7}\\|>` | `123 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 4, 1}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `10 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 4, 1}` | `2` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `8 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 3, 2}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `8 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{5, 3, 2}` | `2` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `7 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{4, 4, 2}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-6, -3, -1}, \"b\" -> {-2, -4}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 6}\\|>` | `79 ms` |\n| `{3, 2, 0}` | `{4, 3, 3}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-4, -1, 1}, \"b\" -> {-2, -4}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 4}\\|>` | `73 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{8, 2, 0}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `5 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{8, 1, 1}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-2, 0, 4}, \"b\" -> {-1, -5}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 2}\\|>` | `74 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{7, 3, 0}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `3 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{7, 2, 1}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `16 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{7, 2, 1}` | `2` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `16 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{6, 4, 0}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `3 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{6, 3, 1}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `16 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{6, 3, 1}` | `2` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `15 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{6, 2, 2}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-3, -1, 3}, \"b\" -> {-1, -5}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 3}\\|>` | `76 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{5, 5, 0}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-7, -5, -1}, \"b\" -> {-1, -5}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 7}\\|>` | `87 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{5, 4, 1}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `16 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{5, 4, 1}` | `2` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `16 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{5, 3, 2}` | `1` | `False` | `False` | `\"-\"` | `2 ms` |\n| `{4, 1, 0}` | `{4, 4, 2}` | `1` | `True` | `True` | `<\\|\"roles\" -> {0, Infinity, 1}, \"a\" -> {-6, -4, 0}, \"b\" -> {-1, -5}, \"gauge\" -> {0, 6}\\|>` | `79 ms` |\n| `number of branches that are 3F2 equations / that have a consecutive pair of exponents / total` | `{20, 20, 45}` |  |  |  |  |  |",
