  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## E4. Degenerate perturbation theory in epsilon (adjoint), zeta = epsilon phi",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* E4 (part 1). Machinery for the perturbation theory in epsilon, zeta = eps*phi: (a) the Laurent-coefficient operators H_s, a_s, b_s of the twisted family on each weight sector as exact polynomials in g = diag(g1,g2,g3) (degree <= 3), obtained by exact interpolation on a 4x4x4 grid of g points (laurentX on the identity block of the sector) and checked at extra points; (b) exact Rayleigh-Schroedinger recursion for the HW-limit branch of the commuting family, using the generic isolating operator Aop = H_1 + rho*a_1 (all Laurent operators commute, so the branch is a joint eigenvector); arithmetic in Q(Sqrt[D0]) as expressions in the symbol sq reduced modulo sq^2 - D0 (octet copies), rational otherwise; (c) Laurent-data series x(eps) from (X(eps) Psi(eps)) = x(eps) Psi(eps) component-wise. theta = (2/7,-3/5) throughout (scaling: the order-n coefficient of H_s, a_s scales as theta12^(n-1), b_s as theta12^(n-2) -- checked at a second theta in part 2). *)\nck = <||>;\nthN = {2/7, -3/5}; th12 = 31/35;\nmons = Flatten[Table[{a, b, c}, {a, 0, 3}, {b, 0, 3 - a}, {c, 0, 3 - a - b}], 2];\npw[x_, 0] := 1; pw[x_, k_] := x^k;\nmonV[g_] := Table[pw[g[[1]], m[[1]]] pw[g[[2]], m[[2]]] pw[g[[3]], m[[3]]], {m, mons}];\ngPts = Tuples[{0, 1, -1, 2}, 3];\ngExtra = {{3/2, -5/7, 2/9}, {-4/3, 5/2, 1/7}};\ndesignM = monV /@ gPts;\nck[\"design matrix rank = 20 (cubic polynomials in 3 variables on the 4x4x4 grid)\"] = MatrixRank[designM];\nopNames = {\"H1\", \"H2\", \"a1\", \"a2\", \"b1\", \"b2\"};\nopAt[R_, g_, sec_, Ib_] := Module[{LD = laurentX[R, DiagonalMatrix[g], thN, Ib]},\n  {LD[\"H\"][[1]], LD[\"H\"][[2]], LD[\"a\"][[1]], LD[\"a\"][[2]], LD[\"b\"][[1]], LD[\"b\"][[2]]}];\n(* operator coefficient blocks: opPoly[{Lam,mu}][name] = list over mons of n x n rational matrices; the identity-block columns are the sector unit vectors, so X.Ib is the operator itself *)\nopPolyOf[Lam_, mu_] := opPolyOfT[Lam, mu, thN];\nopPolyOfT[Lam_, mu_, thArg_] := opPolyOfT[Lam, mu, thArg] = Block[{thN = thArg}, Module[{R = build[Lam], sec = secOf[Lam, mu], n, Ib, vals, design = designM, sols, offsec, chk},\n  n = Length[sec]; Ib = Normal[SparseArray[Transpose[{sec, Range[n]}] -> 1, {R[\"d2\"], n}]];\n  vals = Table[opAt[R, g, sec, Ib], {g, gPts}];\n  offsec = And @@ Flatten[Table[Union[Flatten[Delete[v[[k]], List /@ sec]]] === {0}, {v, vals}, {k, 6}]];\n  sols = Table[With[{V = Table[Flatten[vals[[ip, k]][[sec]]], {ip, Length[gPts]}]}, Partition[#, n] & /@ LinearSolve[design, V]], {k, 6}];\n  (* extra-point check *)\n  chk = And @@ Flatten[Table[With[{vx = opAt[R, g, sec, Ib]}, Table[vx[[k]][[sec]] === Total[Table[monV[g][[im]] sols[[k, im]], {im, Length[mons]}]], {k, 6}]], {g, gExtra}]];\n  <|\"coef\" -> AssociationThread[opNames -> sols], \"offsec\" -> offsec, \"extraOK\" -> chk, \"n\" -> n|>]];\n(* field arithmetic: elements are expressions a + b sq, sq^2 = dD *)\nrd[x_] := If[dD === 0, Expand[x], PolynomialRemainder[Expand[x], sq^2 - dD, sq]];\ncj[x_] := x /. sq -> -sq;\nfdiv[x_, y_] := If[dD === 0, Expand[x/y], rd[rd[x cj[y]]]/rd[y cj[y]]];\nfdotv[a_, b_] := rd[a . b];\n(* order-k operator coefficient (matrix, with numeric or symbolic phi) of the polynomial opPoly: degree-k homogeneous part in phi *)\nopSeries[ops_, name_, phi_, kmax_] := Table[Sum[(Times @@ MapThread[pw, {phi, mons[[im]]}]) ops[\"coef\"][name][[im]], {im, Select[Range[Length[mons]], Total[mons[[#]]] == k &]}], {k, 0, kmax}];\n(* RS recursion: Aks = {A0, A1, ..., AK} matrices (rational, or polynomial in phi); psi0, lam0 in the field; returns {lam list, psi list, ell} to order nMax *)\nrsSolve[Aks_, psi0_, lam0_, nMax_] := Module[{n = Length[psi0], K = Length[Aks] - 1, M0, M1, ell, ell0, ell1, lsf, lams = {lam0}, psis = {psi0}, big, kerv, split, lp, ev0},\n  (* unperturbed right eigenvector check *)\n  ev0 = rd /@ (Aks[[1]] . psi0 - lam0 psi0);\n  (* left null vector of A0 - lam0 in the field *)\n  If[dD === 0,\n   ell = First[NullSpace[Transpose[Aks[[1]]] - lam0 IdentityMatrix[n]]]; ell0 = ell; ell1 = 0 ell,\n   Module[{p = Coefficient[lam0, sq, 0], q = Coefficient[lam0, sq, 1], Mt0, Mt1},\n    Mt0 = Transpose[Aks[[1]]] - p IdentityMatrix[n]; Mt1 = -q IdentityMatrix[n];\n    kerv = First[NullSpace[ArrayFlatten[{{Mt0, dD Mt1}, {Mt1, Mt0}}]]];\n    ell0 = kerv[[1 ;; n]]; ell1 = kerv[[n + 1 ;; 2 n]]; ell = ell0 + sq ell1]];\n  (* matrices of the solve: M = A0 - lam0, constraint ell.x = 0 *)\n  If[dD === 0,\n   big = Join[Aks[[1]] - lam0 IdentityMatrix[n], {ell}]; lsf = Quiet[LinearSolve[big], LinearSolve::sqmat1];\n   split[v_] := Join[v, {0}],\n   Module[{p = Coefficient[lam0, sq, 0], q = Coefficient[lam0, sq, 1], M0m, M1m},\n    M0m = Aks[[1]] - p IdentityMatrix[n]; M1m = -q IdentityMatrix[n];\n    big = Join[ArrayFlatten[{{M0m, dD M1m}, {M1m, M0m}}], {Join[ell0, dD ell1], Join[ell1, ell0]}]; lsf = Quiet[LinearSolve[big], LinearSolve::sqmat1];\n    split[v_] := Join[Coefficient[#, sq, 0] & /@ v, Coefficient[#, sq, 1] & /@ v, {0, 0}]]];\n  Do[Module[{Apsi, lamn, rhs, sol},\n    Apsi = Sum[rd /@ (Aks[[k + 1]] . psis[[nn - k + 1]]), {k, 1, Min[nn, K]}];\n    lamn = fdiv[rd[ell . Apsi], rd[ell . psi0]];\n    AppendTo[lams, lamn];\n    rhs = rd /@ (-Apsi + lamn psi0 + Sum[lams[[k + 1]] psis[[nn - k + 1]], {k, 1, nn - 1}]);\n    (* rhs = -Sum_{k=1..n}(A_k - lam_k) psi_{n-k}, with the k = n term lam_n psi0 included; check ell.rhs = 0 *)\n    sol = lsf[split[rhs]];\n    AppendTo[psis, If[dD === 0, rd /@ sol, rd /@ (sol[[1 ;; n]] + sq sol[[n + 1 ;; 2 n]])]]], {nn, 1, nMax}];\n  <|\"lam\" -> (rd /@ lams), \"psi\" -> psis, \"ell\" -> ell, \"ev0\" -> ev0|>];\n(* Laurent data series of an operator-coefficient list Xks = {X0, X1, ...} on the branch: x(eps) Psi = X(eps) Psi, solved at the pivot component, full eigen-equation checked *)\nlaurSeries[Xks_, psis_, nMax_] := Module[{K = Length[Xks] - 1, pv = First@Select[Range[Length[psis[[1]]]], psis[[1, #]] =!= 0 &], ys, xs = {}, res},\n  ys = Table[Sum[rd /@ (Xks[[k + 1]] . psis[[nn - k + 1]]), {k, 0, Min[nn, K]}], {nn, 0, nMax}];\n  Do[AppendTo[xs, fdiv[rd[ys[[nn + 1, pv]] - Sum[xs[[k + 1]] psis[[nn - k + 1, pv]], {k, 0, nn - 1}]], psis[[1, pv]]]], {nn, 0, nMax}];\n  res = Table[rd /@ (ys[[nn + 1]] - Sum[xs[[k + 1]] psis[[nn - k + 1]], {k, 0, nn}]), {nn, 0, nMax}];\n  {xs, Max[Abs[Flatten[res /. sq -> 1]]] === 0 || Union[Flatten[res]] === {0}}];\n\"part 1 defined\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `\"part 1 defined\"` |\n| --- |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* E4 (part 2). Exact perturbation series of the six adjoint HW-limit branches at the NUMERIC twist direction phi = (1/3,-2/7,5/11) (zeta = eps*phi), to order eps^nMaxN, theta = (2/7,-3/5). rho = 1/7 in the isolating operator Aop = H_1 + rho a_1. For each branch: the Laurent data series H_s(eps), a_s(eps), b_s(eps) (exact rationals, or p + q Sqrt[D0] for the two octet copies), the eigen-equation residual of all six Laurent operators on the series state (exactly zero), the exact checks H_1 + H_2 = sum_{i != j} zeta_i mu_j, b_s = a_s (H_s - a_s)/3 (the no-log relation of the adjoint, c2 = 3) order by order, and the unperturbed gap of the isolating operator. *)\nck = <||>;\nnMaxN = 7; rhoI = 1/7;\nphiA = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}; phiB = {-2/5, 3/8, 7/11};\ntrimOps[l_] := With[{nz = Select[Range[Length[l]], Union[Flatten[l[[#]]]] =!= {0} &]}, If[nz === {}, {l[[1]]}, Take[l, Max[nz]]]];\nserConv[a_, b_, nmax_] := Table[rd[Sum[a[[k + 1]] b[[nn - k + 1]], {k, 0, nn}]], {nn, 0, nmax}];\nrunBranch[Lam_, mu_, ic_, phi_, nMax_] := Module[{ops = opPolyOf[Lam, mu], sec = secOf[Lam, mu], bd = branchData[Lam, mu][[ic]], R = build[Lam], psi0, lam0, Aks, rs, ser = <||>, flags = {}, gsec, gnorm, nsec, gapOK, A0N, ev, lamNum, hSum, bRel, pm},\n  dD = bd[\"D0\"]; nsec = Length[sec];\n  psi0 = bd[\"vA\"][[sec]] + If[dD === 0, 0, sq] bd[\"vB\"][[sec]];\n  lam0 = (bd[\"eta\"][[1, 1]] + rhoI (bd[\"alpha\"][[1, 1]] + sq bd[\"alpha\"][[1, 2]]))/th12;\n  Aks = trimOps[opSeries[ops, \"H1\", phi, 3] + rhoI opSeries[ops, \"a1\", phi, 3]];\n  rs = rsSolve[Aks, psi0, lam0, nMax];\n  Do[With[{r = laurSeries[trimOps[opSeries[ops, nm, phi, 3]], rs[\"psi\"], nMax]}, ser[nm] = r[[1]]; AppendTo[flags, r[[2]]]], {nm, opNames}];\n  gsec = R[\"gd2\"][[sec]];\n  gnorm = Table[rd[Sum[rs[\"psi\"][[k + 1]] . (gsec rs[\"psi\"][[nn - k + 1]]), {k, 0, nn}]], {nn, 0, nMax}];\n  hSum = Table[rd[ser[\"H1\"][[nn + 1]] + ser[\"H2\"][[nn + 1]]], {nn, 0, nMax}];\n  bRel = Table[Table[rd[ser[\"b\" <> ToString[s]][[nn + 1]] - serConv[ser[\"a\" <> ToString[s]], ser[\"H\" <> ToString[s]] - ser[\"a\" <> ToString[s]], nMax][[nn + 1]]/3], {nn, 0, nMax}], {s, 2}];\n  A0N = N[Aks[[1]]]; ev = Eigenvalues[A0N]; lamNum = N[lam0 /. sq -> Sqrt[dD]];\n  <|\"series\" -> ser, \"psi\" -> rs[\"psi\"], \"lam\" -> rs[\"lam\"], \"gnorm\" -> gnorm, \"eigOK\" -> And @@ flags, \"ev0\" -> Max[Abs[Flatten[rs[\"ev0\"] /. sq -> 1]]] === 0 || Union[Flatten[rs[\"ev0\"]]] === {0}, \"hSum\" -> hSum, \"bRel\" -> bRel,\n    \"gap\" -> Min[Abs[ev - lamNum][[Ordering[Abs[ev - lamNum]][[2 ;; All]]]]], \"lam0\" -> lam0, \"sec\" -> sec, \"D0\" -> dD|>];\ndispF[x_] := ToString[If[dD === 0, x, x /. sq -> Sqrt[dD]], InputForm];\nbranchesAdj = Flatten[Table[Table[{mu, ic}, {ic, lauData[{{2, 1, 0}, mu}][\"mult\"]}], {mu, hwSecsOf[{2, 1, 0}]}], 1];\nresA = <||>; tims = <||>;\nDo[tims[b] = First@AbsoluteTiming[resA[b] = runBranch[{2, 1, 0}, b[[1]], b[[2]], phiA, nMaxN]], {b, branchesAdj}];\ntab = Flatten[Table[Module[{r = resA[b], mu = b[[1]]}, dD = r[\"D0\"];\n   Join[{{ToString[b, InputForm], \"time (s)\", tims[b], \"gap of Aop(0) at lam0 (min |ev - lam0|)\", N[r[\"gap\"], 4], \"unperturbed eigen-eq / all six series eigen-eqs exact\", {r[\"ev0\"], r[\"eigOK\"]}, \"\"}},\n    Table[{ToString[b, InputForm], nm, \"orders 0..\" <> ToString[nMaxN], dispF[r[\"series\"][[nm]]]}, {nm, opNames}] /. {a_, nm_, c_, d_} :> {a, nm, c, d, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"},\n    {{ToString[b, InputForm], \"H1+H2 series (expect only eps^1: sum_{i!=j} phi_i mu_j)\", dispF[r[\"hSum\"]], \"exact value\", Total[phiA] Total[mu] - phiA . mu, \"b = a(H-a)/3: residual series s=1,2\", dispF[r[\"bRel\"]], \"\"}}]], {b, branchesAdj}], 1];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"branch (mu, copy)\", \"quantity\", \"info\", \"value\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, tab, List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, b_} :> {a, b}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
