  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* E4 (part 3). The same exact perturbation theory with SYMBOLIC phi = (p1,p2,p3): Laurent-data series to order nSym (polynomials in phi, p + q Sqrt[5] coefficients for the (3,2,1) octet copies), the first-order correction Psi_1 (exact vector linear in phi) and its isotypic (irrep) content. Psi_B(eps) lies in the weight-mu space of V(x)V (the twist is diagonal); Psi_1 is decomposed along the irreps nu >= mu occurring in that weight space with the exact spectral projectors of the total (C2, C3) (distinct irreps have distinct (C2,C3)); the HW-limit state itself is the nu = mu component. Normalisation: intermediate (ell.Psi_n = 0, n >= 1, ell = left null vector of Aop(0) - lam0); the exact G-norm^2 series of Psi(eps) is given too, so that Psi_B = Psi/Sqrt[gnorm2] has G-norm 1. *)\nck = <||>;\nnSym = 3;\npphi = {p1, p2, p3};\ncasSecMats[Lam_, mu_] := Module[{R = build[Lam], sec = secOf[Lam, mu], n, Ib},\n  n = Length[sec]; Ib = Normal[SparseArray[Transpose[{sec, Range[n]}] -> 1, {R[\"d2\"], n}]];\n  {casX[R, 2, Ib][[sec]], casX[R, 3, Ib][[sec]]}];\nisoProj[Lam_, mu_] := Module[{c = casSecMats[Lam, mu], M, evs, n},\n  n = Length[c[[1]]]; M = c[[1]] + c[[2]]/10 + 0 IdentityMatrix[n]; evs = Union[Eigenvalues[M]];\n  Table[{e, Fold[#1 . ((M - #2 IdentityMatrix[n])/(e - #2)) &, IdentityMatrix[n], DeleteCases[evs, e]]}, {e, evs}]];\ncleanPoly[x_] := Collect[Expand[x], pphi, Factor];\ndispS[x_] := ToString[If[dD === 0, cleanPoly[x], Collect[Expand[x /. sq -> Sqrt[dD]], pphi, Simplify]], InputForm];\ntabS = {}; resS = <||>;\nDo[Module[{mu = b[[1]], ic = b[[2]], r, R = build[{2, 1, 0}], iso, secn, psi1, gsec, comps, nuOf},\n  r = runBranch[{2, 1, 0}, mu, ic, pphi, nSym]; resS[b] = r;\n  (* cross-checks: the symbolic series evaluated at phi = phiA (cell E4 numeric) and at the second direction phiB = (-2/5,3/8,7/11) (fresh numeric run) *)\n  Module[{rB = runBranch[{2, 1, 0}, mu, ic, phiB, nSym], symA, symB, dd0 = r[\"D0\"]},\n   dD = dd0;\n   ck[{b, \"symbolic series == numeric series at phiA (all six, orders 0..\" <> ToString[nSym] <> \") and psi_0..psi_\" <> ToString[nSym]}] = And @@ Table[Union[Flatten[rd /@ Expand[(r[\"series\"][nm] /. Thread[pphi -> phiA]) - Take[resA[b][\"series\"][nm], nSym + 1]]]] === {0}, {nm, opNames}] && Union[rd /@ Flatten[Expand[(r[\"psi\"] /. Thread[pphi -> phiA]) - Take[resA[b][\"psi\"], nSym + 1]]]] === {0};\n   ck[{b, \"symbolic series == fresh numeric run at phiB\"}] = And @@ Table[Union[Flatten[rd /@ Expand[(r[\"series\"][nm] /. Thread[pphi -> phiB]) - rB[\"series\"][nm]]]] === {0}, {nm, opNames}] && rB[\"eigOK\"]];\n  AppendTo[tabS, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"all six series eigen-equations exact\", ToString[r[\"eigOK\"]], \"\", \"\"}];\n  Do[AppendTo[tabS, {ToString[b, InputForm], nm <> \" order \" <> ToString[nn], dispS[r[\"series\"][[nm]][[nn + 1]]], \"\", \"\"}], {nm, opNames}, {nn, 0, nSym}];\n  AppendTo[tabS, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"b = a(H-a)/3 residual orders 0..\" <> ToString[nSym], ToString[Union[Flatten[Table[rd[x], {x, Flatten[r[\"bRel\"]]}]]], InputForm], \"\", \"\"}];\n  (* Psi_1 and its content *)\n  secn = r[\"sec\"]; gsec = R[\"gd2\"][[secn]]; psi1 = r[\"psi\"][[2]]; iso = isoProj[{2, 1, 0}, mu];\n  nuOf[e_] := Module[{cc = casSecMats[{2, 1, 0}, mu], ev2, ev3, vv},\n    Select[hwSecsOf[{2, 1, 0}], With[{ld = lauData[{{2, 1, 0}, #}]}, ld[\"cas2\"] + ld[\"cas3\"]/10 == e] &]];\n  AppendTo[tabS, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"Psi_0 (sector coordinates, unnormalised)\", ToString[r[\"psi\"][[1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[dD], InputForm], \"G-norm^2 series (orders 0..\" <> ToString[nSym] <> \")\", dispS[#] & /@ r[\"gnorm\"][[1 ;; nSym + 1]]}];\n  AppendTo[tabS, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"Psi_1 (sector coordinates, unnormalised)\", ToString[Collect[Expand[psi1 /. sq -> Sqrt[dD]], pphi, Simplify], InputForm], \"\", \"\"}];\n  AppendTo[tabS, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"irreps nu present in the weight-mu space (by (C2 + C3/10) eigenvalue)\", ToString[{#[[1]], nuOf[#[[1]]]} & /@ iso, InputForm], \"\", \"\"}];\n  comps = Table[Module[{c = rd /@ (pe[[2]] . psi1)}, {pe[[1]], nuOf[pe[[1]]], If[Union[c] === {0}, 0, ToString[Collect[Expand[c /. sq -> Sqrt[dD]], pphi, Simplify], InputForm]], dispS[rd[c . (gsec c)]]}], {pe, iso}];\n  Do[AppendTo[tabS, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"Psi_1 component in irrep \" <> ToString[c[[2]], InputForm] <> \" (key \" <> ToString[c[[1]]] <> \"): vector; G-norm^2\", ToString[c[[3]], InputForm], c[[4]], \"\"}], {c, comps}]], {b, branchesAdj}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"branch\", \"quantity\", \"exact value (symbolic phi = p1,p2,p3; theta = (2/7,-3/5))\", \"extra\", \"\"}}, tabS, List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, b_} :> {ToString[a, InputForm], b, \"\", \"\", \"\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
