   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* E4 (part 4). (i) The theta-scaling law of the series, checked exactly: rescaling u = lam u', theta = lam theta', zeta = zeta'/lam gives H_s^(n)(theta12) = theta12^(n-1) H_s^(n)(1), a_s^(n)(theta12) = theta12^(n-1) a_s^(n)(1), b_s^(n)(theta12) = theta12^(n-2) b_s^(n)(1) (the order-n coefficient of the eps-series carries n powers of zeta); verified by recomputing every branch at theta = (1,0) (new operator blocks) and comparing orders 0..nMaxN exactly. (ii) The second twist direction phi' = (-2/5,3/8,7/11): fresh exact series to order nMaxN, with the exact checks H_1 + H_2 = sum_{i != j} phi'_i mu_j and b_s = a_s (H_s - a_s)/3. The H_s, a_s, b_s series of the six branches at both directions are printed (orders 0..5) for the data file. *)\nck = <||>; tabP = {}; resB = <||>;\nDo[Module[{mu = b[[1]], ic = b[[2]], rA = resA[b], rS, rB, scl},\n  rS = Block[{thN = {1, 0}, th12 = 1}, runBranch[{2, 1, 0}, mu, ic, phiA, nMaxN]];\n  dD = rA[\"D0\"];\n  ck[{b, \"theta scaling of all six series (orders 0..\" <> ToString[nMaxN] <> \") against theta = (1,0)\"}] = And @@ Table[Union[Flatten[rd /@ Expand[Table[rA[\"series\"][nm][[n + 1]] - (31/35)^(n - If[StringTake[nm, 1] == \"b\", 2, 1]) rS[\"series\"][nm][[n + 1]], {n, 0, nMaxN}]]]] === {0}, {nm, opNames}];\n  rB = runBranch[{2, 1, 0}, mu, ic, phiB, nMaxN]; dD = rB[\"D0\"];\n  ck[{b, \"phi': eigen-equations exact, H1+H2 = sum_{i!=j} phi'_i mu_j (only order 1), b = a(H-a)/3\"}] = {rB[\"eigOK\"], rB[\"hSum\"] === Join[{0, Total[phiB] Total[mu] - phiB . mu}, ConstantArray[0, nMaxN - 1]], Union[Flatten[rB[\"bRel\"]]] === {0}};\n  AppendTo[tabP, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"phi' H1 orders 0..5\", ToString[Take[rB[\"series\"][\"H1\"], 6] /. sq -> Sqrt[dD], InputForm]}];\n  AppendTo[tabP, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"phi' a1 orders 0..5\", ToString[Take[rB[\"series\"][\"a1\"], 6] /. sq -> Sqrt[dD], InputForm]}];\n  resB[b] = rB], {b, branchesAdj}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"item\", \"result\", \"\"}}, List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, c_} :> {ToString[a, InputForm], c, \"\"}, tabP], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
