  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## E5. Exact leading orders in the regime: x(zeta), <x0^G|Psi_B>, CG generating function",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* E5 (part A). The covector x(zeta) = e1^T P_phys^(G -1) of x0^G = x(zeta)(x)x(zeta), exactly and symbolically in zeta = (z1,z2,z3), for every rep (round-1 construction: x = e1 . ppinv . dinv . pminv with the Gauss factors of P_phys). Checks: homogeneity (all components homogeneous polynomials of one common degree?), the adjoint closed form quoted in the plan (up to a scalar), and the exact undo identity <Omega_inf(zeta,w1) (x) Omega_inf(zeta,w1')|h> = <phi_u (x) e1|h> on every HW ket (rational test point, zeta = eps phi, w = eps what, eps-free). *)\nck = <||>;\nexpE[R_, c_, i_, j_] := Module[{E = Normal[R[\"Ee\"][[i, j]]], nl = R[\"nilp\"]}, IdentityMatrix[R[\"d1\"]] + Sum[c^k MatrixPower[E, k]/k!, {k, 1, nl}]];\nrowExpR[R_, v_, c_, i_, j_] := v + Sum[c^k/k! (v . MatrixPower[Normal[R[\"Ee\"][[i, j]]], k]), {k, 1, R[\"nilp\"]}];\ncoverGs[R_, {p1_, p2_, p3_}] := rowExpR[R, rowExpR[R, rowExpR[R, UnitVector[R[\"d1\"], 1], p1, 1, 2], p2, 1, 3], p3, 2, 3];\n(* x(zeta): row vector e1 . expN(-(z1+z2)/(z1 z2) E23) expN(1/(z1 z2) E13) expN(-1/z1 E12) . dinv . expN(-r3 E21) expN(-r2 E31) expN(-r1 E32) *)\nxOfSym[Lam_] := Module[{R = build[Lam], z = {z1, z2, z3}, sv, rv, v, dinv},\n  sv = {z1^2/((z1 - z2) (z1 - z3)), -(z2/(z1 (z2 - z3))), 1/(z1 z2)};\n  rv = {-(z3/z2), -(z3/z1), (z2^2 (z3 - z1))/(z1^2 (z2 - z3))};\n  v = UnitVector[R[\"d1\"], 1] . expE[R, -((z1 + z2)/(z1 z2)), 2, 3];\n  v = v . expE[R, 1/(z1 z2), 1, 3]; v = v . expE[R, -1/z1, 1, 2];\n  dinv = DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[sv[[k]]^(-J0[k][p]), {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Lam}]}]];\n  v = v . dinv; v = v . expE[R, -rv[[3]], 2, 1]; v = v . expE[R, -rv[[2]], 3, 1]; v = v . expE[R, -rv[[1]], 3, 2];\n  Factor /@ Together /@ v];\nxTab = <||>;\nDo[Module[{t0 = AbsoluteTime[], x, degs, homog},\n  x = xOfSym[Lam]; xTab[Lam] = x;\n  degs = Table[If[xi === 0, \"0\", Union[{Exponent[xi /. {z1 -> t z1, z2 -> t z2, z3 -> t z3}, t]}]], {xi, x}];\n  ck[{Lam, \"x(zeta): components are polynomials (denominator 1) and homogeneous: degrees\"}] = {And @@ (PolynomialQ[#, {z1, z2, z3}] & /@ x), Union[Flatten[degs /. \"0\" -> {}]]};\n  ck[{Lam, \"time\"}] = ToString[Round[1000 (AbsoluteTime[] - t0)]] <> \" ms\"], {Lam, {{1, 1, 0}, {2, 1, 0}, {2, 2, 0}, {3, 1, 0}, {3, 2, 0}, {4, 1, 0}}}];\nxAdjProp = {z2 - z1, z3 - z1, z2 - z1, 2 z3 - z1 - z2, 3 (z2 - z1), 3 (z3 - z1), 2 (z3 - z2), 3 (z3 - z2)};\nck[\"adjoint x(zeta) == plan closed form (exactly, or up to a common factor)\"] = With[{r = Together[xTab[{2, 1, 0}]/xAdjProp]}, r];\n(* the undo identity, exact, at a rational point: Omega_inf(eps phi, eps w) (x) Omega_inf(eps phi, eps w') on every HW ket = <phi_u (x) e1|h> *)\nrInfG[zz_, w1_] := {(w1 - zz[[1]])/(w1 - zz[[2]]), -((w1 - zz[[1]]) (zz[[2]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (w1 - zz[[3]])), ((w1 - zz[[2]]) (zz[[1]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (w1 - zz[[3]]))};\nphiUparams[ph_, o1_, o2_] := {(ph[[1]] - ph[[2]]) (o1 - o2)/((ph[[2]] - o1) (ph[[2]] - o2)), (ph[[3]] - ph[[1]]) (ph[[3]] - ph[[2]]) (o1 - o2)/((ph[[3]] - o1) (ph[[2]] - o2) (ph[[3]] - o2)), (ph[[1]] - ph[[3]]) (ph[[2]] - ph[[3]]) (o1 - o2)/((ph[[1]] - ph[[2]]) (ph[[3]] - o1) (ph[[3]] - o2))};\nundoCheck[Lam_] := Module[{R = build[Lam], ph = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}, o1 = 3/4, o2 = -12/5, results = {}, e = 10^-3, d1 = build[Lam][\"d1\"]},\n  Table[Module[{zz = ep ph, w1 = ep o1, w2 = ep o2, cov1, cov2, phiU, phi2, hws},\n    cov1 = coverGs[R, rInfG[zz, w1]]; cov2 = coverGs[R, rInfG[zz, w2]];\n    phiU = coverGs[R, phiUparams[ph, o1, o2]];\n    Flatten[Table[Table[With[{h = embed[Lam, mu, k]}, {Flatten[KroneckerProduct[cov1, cov2]] . h, Flatten[KroneckerProduct[phiU, UnitVector[d1, 1]]] . h}], {k, hwK[Lam, mu]}], {mu, hwSecsOf[Lam]}], 1]], {ep, {1/1000, 3/7}}]];\nck[\"undo identity <Omega(w)(x)Omega(w')|h> = <phi_u (x) e1|h> on every HW ket, adjoint, eps = 1/1000 and 3/7: all equal\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[#[[1]] === #[[2]] & /@ blk, {blk, undoCheck[{2, 1, 0}]}]];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"item\", \"result\"}}, List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, b_} :> {a, b}, Table[{\"x(zeta) for \" <> ToString[Lam, InputForm], ToString[xTab[Lam], InputForm]}, {Lam, {{1, 1, 0}, {2, 1, 0}, {2, 2, 0}}}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
