   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `item` | `result` |\n| --- | --- |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"x(zeta): components are polynomials (denominator 1) and homogeneous: degrees\"}` | `{True, {1}}` |\n| `{{1, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `2 ms` |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"x(zeta): components are polynomials (denominator 1) and homogeneous: degrees\"}` | `{True, {1}}` |\n| `{{2, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `17 ms` |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"x(zeta): components are polynomials (denominator 1) and homogeneous: degrees\"}` | `{True, {2}}` |\n| `{{2, 2, 0}, \"time\"}` | `12 ms` |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"x(zeta): components are polynomials (denominator 1) and homogeneous: degrees\"}` | `{True, {1}}` |\n| `{{3, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `51 ms` |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"x(zeta): components are polynomials (denominator 1) and homogeneous: degrees\"}` | `{True, {2}}` |\n| `{{3, 2, 0}, \"time\"}` | `70 ms` |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"x(zeta): components are polynomials (denominator 1) and homogeneous: degrees\"}` | `{True, {1}}` |\n| `{{4, 1, 0}, \"time\"}` | `143 ms` |\n| `adjoint x(zeta) == plan closed form (exactly, or up to a common factor)` | `{1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1}` |\n| `undo identity <Omega(w)(x)Omega(w')\\|h> = <phi_u (x) e1\\|h> on every HW ket, adjoint, eps = 1/1000 and 3/7: all equal` | `True` |\n| `x(zeta) for {1, 1, 0}` | `{-z1 + z2, -z1 + z3, -z2 + z3}` |\n| `x(zeta) for {2, 1, 0}` | `{-z1 + z2, -z1 + z3, -z1 + z2, -z1 - z2 + 2*z3, -3*(z1 - z2), -3*(z1 - z3), -2*(z2 - z3), -3*(z2 - z3)}` |\n| `x(zeta) for {2, 2, 0}` | `{(z1 - z2)^2, 2*(z1 - z2)*(z1 - z3), 2*(z1 - z3)^2, 2*(z1 - z2)*(z2 - z3), -4*(z1 - z3)*(-z2 + z3), 4*(z2 - z3)^2}` |",
