  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* E5 (part B). Exact leading orders in the regime zeta = eps phi, omega = eps what, omega' = eps what' (phi, what, what' symbolic) for the adjoint HW-limit branches Psi_B(eps) = Psi_0 + eps Psi_1 + ... (exact perturbation series, cell E4, to order nE5). (i) <x0^G|Psi_B> with x0^G = x(eps phi)(x)x(eps phi) = eps^2 x(phi)(x)x(phi) (x is homogeneous of degree 1 for the adjoint): the exponent 2 + k_B, k_B = first order n at which <x(phi)(x)x(phi)|Psi_n> is not identically zero in phi, and that coefficient (with Psi_B G-normalised: divide by Sqrt[gnorm0]). (ii) The CG generating function: with c = eps^(4 lam1) chat, chat = (p2-w1)^(lam1-lam2) (p3-w1)^lam1 (p2-w1')^(lam1-lam2) (p3-w1')^lam1 (p1-p2)^(2 lam2), <Phi_inf|Psi_B> = <phi_u (x) e1|Psi_B> exactly (undo identity of cell E5A), so chat <phi_u(x)e1|Psi_n> = Sum_nu W_nu(phi,w1,w1') s_n[nu], W_nu = chat [e1 rho(n')]_nu (a polynomial in w1, w1'), s_n[nu] = Psi_n at product index (nu,1) (the slice at site-2 = HW; only the weight nu = mu - Lambda carries it). *)\nck = <||>;\nnE5 = 4; ww = {o1, o2};\nxvec = xTab[{2, 1, 0}] /. {z1 -> p1, z2 -> p2, z3 -> p3};\nxx = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[xvec, xvec]];\nRad = build[{2, 1, 0}]; d1a = Rad[\"d1\"];\nchat = (p2 - o1)^(1) (p3 - o1)^2 (p2 - o2)^1 (p3 - o2)^2 (p1 - p2)^2;\ncovU = coverGs[Rad, phiUparams[pphi, o1, o2]];\nWnu = Table[Factor[Together[chat covU[[nu]]]], {nu, d1a}];\nck[\"chat * (e1 rho(n'))_nu is a polynomial in (w1, w1') for nu = 1..6 and 8 (all nu carrying a CG slice); nu = 7 has the simple pole 1/(w1' - p2) (its weight is never reached by a slice)\"] = {And @@ (PolynomialQ[#, {o1, o2}] & /@ Wnu[[{1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8}]]), PolynomialQ[#, {o1, o2}] & /@ {Wnu[[7]]}};\nsliceVec[sec_, psi_] := Table[With[{idx = (nu - 1) d1a + 1}, If[MemberQ[sec, idx], psi[[First@Flatten[Position[sec, idx]]]], 0]], {nu, d1a}];\nresE = <||>; tabE = {};\nDo[Module[{mu = b[[1]], ic = b[[2]], r, sec, On, kB, gn0, lead, slices, GF},\n  r = runBranch[{2, 1, 0}, mu, ic, pphi, nE5]; resE[b] = r; sec = r[\"sec\"]; gn0 = r[\"gnorm\"][[1]];\n  On = Table[rd[xx[[sec]] . r[\"psi\"][[n + 1]]], {n, 0, nE5}];\n  kB = First@Select[Range[0, nE5], On[[# + 1]] =!= 0 &];\n  AppendTo[tabE, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"all six series eigen-equations exact (to order \" <> ToString[nE5] <> \")\", ToString[r[\"eigOK\"]], \"\"}];\n  AppendTo[tabE, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"<x(phi)(x)x(phi)|Psi_n>, n = 0..\" <> ToString[nE5] <> \" (intermediate normalisation, unnormalised Psi_0)\", ToString[Table[If[On[[n + 1]] === 0, 0, ToString[Collect[Expand[On[[n + 1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[dD]], pphi, Simplify], InputForm]], {n, 0, nE5}], InputForm], \"\"}];\n  AppendTo[tabE, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"k_B (first nonzero order); exponent of eps in <x0^G|Psi_B>: 2 + k_B\", ToString[{kB, 2 + kB}, InputForm], \"\"}];\n  lead = On[[kB + 1]]; \n  AppendTo[tabE, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"leading coefficient <x(phi)(x)x(phi)|Psi_kB> (unnormalised) and Psi_0 G-norm^2 (divide by its Sqrt)\", dispS[lead], ToString[gn0 /. sq -> Sqrt[dD], InputForm]}];\n  slices = Table[sliceVec[sec, r[\"psi\"][[n + 1]]], {n, 0, 2}];\n  AppendTo[tabE, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"slices s_n[nu] = Psi_n(nu,1), n = 0,1,2, nu = 1..8 (unnormalised, intermediate normalisation)\", ToString[Table[Collect[Expand[# /. sq -> Sqrt[dD]], pphi, Simplify] & /@ s, {s, slices}], InputForm], \"\"}];\n  GF = Table[Collect[Expand[Sum[Wnu[[nu]] rd[s[[nu]]], {nu, d1a}] /. sq -> Sqrt[dD]], {o1, o2}, Simplify], {s, slices}];\n  AppendTo[tabE, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"chat <phi_u (x) e1|Psi_0> (unnormalised Psi_0) as a polynomial in (w1, w1')\", ToString[GF[[1]], InputForm], \"\"}];\n  AppendTo[tabE, {ToString[b, InputForm], \"chat <phi_u (x) e1|Psi_1> (the O(eps) correction, same normalisation)\", ToString[GF[[2]], InputForm], \"\"}]], {b, branchesAdj}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"branch\", \"quantity\", \"exact value\", \"extra\"}}, Table[{\"W_nu, nu = \" <> ToString[nu], ToString[Wnu[[nu]], InputForm], \"\", \"\"}, {nu, d1a}], tabE, List @@@ Normal[ck] /. {a_, b_} :> {a, b, \"\", \"\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
