, 2}, 1}` | `all six series eigen-equations exact (to order 4)` | `True` |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 2}, 1}` | `<x(phi)(x)x(phi)\\|Psi_n>, n = 0..4 (intermediate normalisation, unnormalised Psi_0)` | `{0, 0, 0, 0, \"(923521*p2^4*p3^2)/24010000 - (923521*p2^3*p3^3)/12005000 + (923521*p2^2*p3^4)/24010000 + p1^4*((923521*p2^2)/24010000 - (923521*p2*p3)/12005000 + (923521*p3^2)/24010000) + p1^3*((-923521*p2^3)/12005000 + (923521*p2^2*p3)/12005000 + (923521*p2*p3^2)/12005000 - (923521*p3^3)/12005000) + p1^2*((923521*p2^4)/24010000 + (923521*p2^3*p3)/12005000 - (2770563*p2^2*p3^2)/12005000 + (923521*p2*p3^3)/12005000 + (923521*p3^4)/24010000) + p1*((-923521*p2^4*p3)/12005000 + (923521*p2^3*p3^2)/12005000 + (923521*p2^2*p3^3)/12005000 - (923521*p2*p3^4)/12005000)\"}` |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 2}, 1}` | `k_B (first nonzero order); exponent of eps in <x0^G\\|Psi_B>: 2 + k_B` | `{4, 6}` |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 2}, 1}` | `leading coefficient <x(phi)(x)x(phi)\\|Psi_kB> (unnormalised) and Psi_0 G-norm^2 (divide by its Sqrt)` | `(923521*p2^4*p3^2)/24010000 - (923521*p2^3*p3^3)/12005000 + (923521*p2^2*p3^4)/24010000 + p1^4*((923521*p2^2)/24010000 - (923521*p2*p3)/12005000 + (923521*p3^2)/24010000) + p1^3*((-923521*p2^3)/12005000 + (923521*p2^2*p3)/12005000 + (923521*p2*p3^2)/12005000 - (923521*p3^3)/12005000) + p1^2*((923521*p2^4)/24010000 + (923521*p2^3*p3)/12005000 - (2770563*p2^2*p3^2)/12005000 + (923521*p2*p3^3)/12005000 + (923521*p3^4)/24010000) + p1*((-923521*p2^4*p3)/12005000 + (923521*p2^3*p3^2)/12005000 + (923521*p2^2*p3^3)/12005000 - (923521*p2*p3^4)/12005000)` | `288` |\n| `{{2, 2, 2}, 1}` | `slices s_n[nu] = Psi_n(nu,1), n = 0,1,2, nu = 1..8 (unnormalised, intermediate normalisation)` | `{{0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2}, {0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, (62*p1)/105 - (62*p3)/105}, {0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, (961*p1^2)/17640 - (961*p2^2)/12600 + p1*((961*p2)/12600 - (16337*p3)/88200) + (961*p2*p3)/12600 + (961*p3^2)/17640}}` |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 2}, 1}` | `chat <phi_u (x) e1\\|Psi_0> (unnormalised Psi_0) as a polynomial in (w1, w1')` | `-6*o1^2*(p1 - p2)^2*(p1 - p3)^2*(p2 - p3)^2 + 12*o1*o2*(p1 - p2)^2*(p1 - p3)^2*(p2 - p3)^2 - 6*o2^2*(p1 - p2)^2*(p1 - p3)^2*(p2 - p3)^2` |  |\n| `{{2, 2, 2}, 1}` | `chat <phi_u (x) e1\\|Psi_1> (the O(eps) correction, same normalisation)` | `(-62*o1^2*(p1 - p2)^2*(p1 - p3)^3*(p2 - p3)^2)/35 + (124*o1*o2*(p1 - p2)^2*(p1 - p3)^3*(p2 - p3)^2)/35 - (62*o2^2*(p1 - p2)^2*(p1 - p3)^3*(p2 - p3)^2)/35` |  |\n| `chat * (e1 rho(n'))_nu is a polynomial in (w1, w1') for nu = 1..6 and 8 (all nu carrying a CG slice); nu = 7 has the simple pole 1/(w1' - p2) (its weight is never reached by a slice)` | `{True, {False}}` |  |  |",
