  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Data files, part 2 (perturbation series, x(zeta), E5 records)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Data files, part 2. Appends the perturbation-theory records (E4/E5) to ref/untwisted-exact-210.txt and the covector x(zeta) records to every ref/untwisted-exact-<l1><l2><l3>.txt (this cell must run after the cell that wrote the files; re-running the file-writing cell first restores the header). All series are exact: pairs {p,q} mean p + q Sqrt[D0] (D0 = 0: rational). *)\nck = <||>;\npairOf[x_] := {Coefficient[x, sq, 0], Coefficient[x, sq, 1]};\nfmt2[x_] := StringReplace[ToString[x, InputForm, PageWidth -> Infinity], {\"\\n\" -> \"\", \" \" -> \"\"}];\nappendLines[file_, lines_] := Module[{str = OpenAppend[file, CharacterEncoding -> \"UTF-8\"]}, Do[WriteString[str, l <> \"\\n\"], {l, lines}]; Close[str]];\nadjFile = refDir <> \"untwisted-exact-210.txt\";\nhdr = {\n \"# ---- PART 2 (appended): exact degenerate perturbation theory in eps, zeta = eps*phi, theta = (2/7,-3/5), theta12 = 31/35 (adjoint only) ----\",\n \"# E4_SERIES mu copy D0 phi nmax {H1,H2} {a1,a2} {b1,b2} : H_s(eps) = Sum_n eps^n H_s^(n) etc. for the HW-limit branch of the twisted family (branch = eigenvector of the commuting family tending to the HW state BRANCH mu copy of part 1); each list has nmax+1 pairs {p,q} (order n = 0..nmax). Exact: H1+H2 = Sum_{i!=j} phi_i mu_j at order 1 only; b_s = a_s (H_s - a_s)/3 order by order (adjoint no-log relation, c2 = 3).\",\n \"# E4_SYMBOLIC mu copy D0 name {order0,order1,...,order3} : the same series with symbolic phi = (p1,p2,p3) as Wolfram InputForm strings (name = H1,H2,a1,a2,b1,b2; Sqrt[5] etc. appear only for the octet copies).\",\n \"# theta scaling (verified exactly): H^(n) and a^(n) scale as theta12^(n-1), b^(n) as theta12^(n-2).\",\n \"# E4_PSI mu copy D0 phi nmax ell psi0 psi1 ... : Psi(eps) = Sum eps^n Psi_n in sector coordinates (the product-basis indices SECIDX of weight mu), intermediate normalisation ell.Psi_n = 0 (n>=1), Psi_0 = the BRANCH vector restricted to the sector; entries are pairs {p,q}; G-norm^2 series of Psi in E4_GNORM (pairs); the normalised branch is Psi/Sqrt[gnorm2].\",\n \"# E5_KB mu copy kB lead gnorm0 (strings; Sqrt[D0] appears for the octet copies) : <x0^G|Psi_B> = eps^(2+kB) lead/Sqrt[gnorm0] + ..., lead = <x(phi) (x) x(phi)|Psi_kB> (string, symbolic phi), x0^G = x(zeta) (x) x(zeta) with x from XVEC.\",\n \"# E5_SLICE mu copy n slice : Psi_n at product index (nu,1), nu = 1..DIM (strings, symbolic phi); E5_GF mu copy n poly : chat <phi_u (x) e1|Psi_n> as a polynomial in w1,w1' (o1,o2) and phi (strings), chat = (p2-o1)(p3-o1)^2(p2-o2)(p3-o2)^2(p1-p2)^2.\",\n \"# XVEC {x_nu(z1,z2,z3)} : the one-site covector x(zeta) = e1^T P_phys^(G -1) (strings), x0^G = x(zeta) (x) x(zeta), homogeneous of degree lam2 in zeta.\"};\nlines = hdr;\nDo[Module[{r = resA[b], rb = resB[b], rs = resS[b], re = resE[b], mu = b[[1]], ic = b[[2]], d0},\n  dD = r[\"D0\"]; d0 = dD;\n  AppendTo[lines, StringRiffle[{\"E4_SERIES\", fmt2[mu], fmt2[ic], fmt2[d0], fmt2[phiA], fmt2[nMaxN], fmt2[Table[pairOf[#] & /@ r[\"series\"][nm], {nm, {\"H1\", \"H2\"}}]], fmt2[Table[pairOf[#] & /@ r[\"series\"][nm], {nm, {\"a1\", \"a2\"}}]], fmt2[Table[pairOf[#] & /@ r[\"series\"][nm], {nm, {\"b1\", \"b2\"}}]]}, \"\\t\"]];\n  dD = rb[\"D0\"];\n  AppendTo[lines, StringRiffle[{\"E4_SERIES\", fmt2[mu], fmt2[ic], fmt2[d0], fmt2[phiB], fmt2[nMaxN], fmt2[Table[pairOf[#] & /@ rb[\"series\"][nm], {nm, {\"H1\", \"H2\"}}]], fmt2[Table[pairOf[#] & /@ rb[\"series\"][nm], {nm, {\"a1\", \"a2\"}}]], fmt2[Table[pairOf[#] & /@ rb[\"series\"][nm], {nm, {\"b1\", \"b2\"}}]]}, \"\\t\"]];\n  Do[AppendTo[lines, StringRiffle[{\"E4_SYMBOLIC\", fmt2[mu], fmt2[ic], fmt2[d0], nm, fmt2[Table[ToString[rs[\"series\"][nm][[n + 1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[d0], InputForm], {n, 0, 3}]]}, \"\\t\"]], {nm, opNames}];\n  AppendTo[lines, StringRiffle[{\"E4_PSI\", fmt2[mu], fmt2[ic], fmt2[d0], fmt2[phiA], fmt2[nMaxN], fmt2[secOf[{2, 1, 0}, mu]], fmt2[pairOf[#] & /@ r[\"ell\"]]} ~Join~ (fmt2[pairOf[#] & /@ #] & /@ r[\"psi\"]), \"\\t\"]];\n  AppendTo[lines, StringRiffle[{\"E4_GNORM\", fmt2[mu], fmt2[ic], fmt2[d0], fmt2[phiA], fmt2[pairOf[#] & /@ r[\"gnorm\"]]}, \"\\t\"]];\n  Module[{On, kB, sec = re[\"sec\"], dD2 = re[\"D0\"]},\n   dD = dD2; On = Table[rd[xx[[sec]] . re[\"psi\"][[n + 1]]], {n, 0, nE5}]; kB = First@Select[Range[0, nE5], On[[# + 1]] =!= 0 &];\n   AppendTo[lines, StringRiffle[{\"E5_KB\", fmt2[mu], fmt2[ic], fmt2[kB], ToString[On[[kB + 1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[dD2], InputForm], ToString[re[\"gnorm\"][[1]] /. sq -> Sqrt[dD2], InputForm]}, \"\\t\"]];\n   Do[AppendTo[lines, StringRiffle[{\"E5_SLICE\", fmt2[mu], fmt2[ic], fmt2[n], ToString[sliceVec[sec, re[\"psi\"][[n + 1]]] /. sq -> Sqrt[dD2], InputForm]}, \"\\t\"]], {n, 0, 2}];\n   Do[AppendTo[lines, StringRiffle[{\"E5_GF\", fmt2[mu], fmt2[ic], fmt2[n], ToString[Collect[Expand[Sum[Wnu[[nu]] rd[sliceVec[sec, re[\"psi\"][[n + 1]]][[nu]]], {nu, d1a}] /. sq -> Sqrt[dD2]], {o1, o2}, Simplify], InputForm]}, \"\\t\"]], {n, 0, 1}]]], {b, branchesAdj}];\nAppendTo[lines, \"XVEC\\t\" <> fmt2[ToString[#, InputForm] & /@ xTab[{2, 1, 0}]]];\nappendLines[adjFile, lines];\nDo[If[Lam =!= {2, 1, 0}, appendLines[refDir <> \"untwisted-exact-\" <> StringJoin[ToString /@ Lam] <> \".txt\", {\"# XVEC {x_nu(z1,z2,z3)} : the one-site covector x(zeta) = e1^T P_phys^(G -1) (strings, symbolic zeta), x0^G = x(zeta) (x) x(zeta), homogeneous of degree lam2 in zeta.\", \"XVEC\\t\" <> fmt2[ToString[#, InputForm] & /@ xTab[Lam]]}]], {Lam, repList}];\nck[\"lines appended to the adjoint file\"] = Length[lines];\nck[\"adjoint file size (bytes)\"] = FileByteCount[adjFile];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"item\", \"value\"}}, Table[{ToString[k, InputForm], ck[k]}, {k, Keys[ck]}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell above (evaluated from exactly the saved source in kernel K1; not a native notebook output).*\n\n| `item` | `value` |\n| --- | --- |\n| `\"lines appended to the adjoint file\"` | `105` |\n| `\"adjoint file size (bytes)\"` | `58754` |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
